t was the world''s biggest online retailer . Amazon sells books , electronics , pharmaceuticals , car parts , video games , dining products, jewelry , food , music , and sports equipment . [8] The company has multiple subsidiaries, including Amazon Web Services (AWS), which provides cloud computing; Zoox , a self-driving car division; satellite Internet provider Kuiper Systems ; and Amazon Lab126 , a computer hardware R&amp;D provider. Other subsidiaries include Ring , Twitch , IMDb , and grocer Whole', '["clm_wiki_amazon_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
