  ('cs_cencora_leadership', 'org_cencora', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Products They provide drug distribution and consulting related to medical business operations and patient services. They also distribute a line of brand name and generic pharmaceuticals , over-the-counter (OTC) health care products and home health care supplies and equipment to health care providers throughout the United States , including acute care hospitals and health systems , independent and chain retail pharmacies , mail-order facilities, physicians , clinics and other alternate site facilities, as well as nursing and assisted living centers. They also provide pharmaceuticals and pharmacy services to long-term care, workers'' compensation and specialty drug patients. AmerisourceBergen handles about 20% of all of the pharmaceuticals sold and distributed throughout the United States and ranked 10th on the Fortune 500 list for 2020 with over $179 billion in annual revenue. [1] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "AmerisourceBergen | 2020 Fortune 500" . Fortune . Retrieved January 12, 2021 .', '["clm_wiki_cencora_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
