   'Caterpillars are the larval stage of members of the order Lepidoptera. In common speech, any caterpillar-shaped insect larva such as of a sawfly is often called a caterpillar.', '["clm_wiki_caterpillar_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
