  ('cs_baker-hughes_history', 'org_baker-hughes', 'overview', 'History',
   'Divisions The company divides its organization into the following segments: [1] Oilfield Services and Equipment – provides drilling, completion, production, intervention, subsea systems, flexible pipes, and related services for petroleum and geothermal industries. [1] Industrial and Energy Technology – supplies equipment and services for mechanical drive, compression, power generation, and measurement, as well as climate-related technologies such as carbon capture, hydrogen, and emissions management. [1] The company has acquired many legacy brands and businesses over the years, including Bently Nevada . ^ a b c body:not( ):not( ) Hampson, Liz (September 6, 2022). "Baker Hughes to simplify organization into two units" . Reuters . p. 1 . Retrieved September 6, 2022 .', '["clm_wiki_baker-hughes_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
