  ('cs_schlumberger_overview', 'org_schlumberger', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'SLB, formerly known as Schlumberger, is a multinational oilfield services company. Founded in France in 1926, the company is now incorporated as SLB N.V. in Willemstad, Curaçao, with principal executive offices in four cities: Paris, France; Houston, Texas, United States; London, UK; and The Hague, Netherlands. As of 2022, it is both the world''s largest offshore drilling company and the world''s largest offshore drilling contractor by revenue.', '["clm_wiki_schlumberger_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
