VALUES
  ('cs_southwest-airlines_operations', 'org_southwest-airlines', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Corporate affairs Business trends The key trends for Southwest Airlines are (as of the end of the calendar year): [1] Key business trends Year Net income (in million US$) Employees ( FTE ) Passengers (in millions) Load factor (%) Avg. fare (US$) Aircraft &#91; a &#93; Ref. 2015 2,181 49,583 118 83.6 154 704 [2] 2016 2,183 53,536 124 84.0 152 723 [2] 2017 3,357 56,110 130 83.9 151 706 [2] 2018 2,465 58,803 134 83.4 151 750 [2] 2019 2,700 60,767 134 83.5 154 770 [3] 2020 −3,074 − 56,537 0 54 52.4 141 718 [4] 2021 0, 977 55,093 0 99 78.5 141 728 [3] 2022 0, 539 66,656 126 83.4 169 770 [3] 2023 0, 465 74,806 137 80.0 172 817 [5] 2024 0, 465 72,450 140 80.4 178 803 [6] 2025 0, 441 72,790 134 77.4 190 803 [7] Headquarters Southwest Airlines'' headquarters at Dallas Love Field in Dallas The Southwest Airlines headquarters are located on the grounds of Dallas Love Field in Dallas . [8] [9] On September 17, 2012, Southwest broke ground on a new Training and Operational Support building, [10] across the street from its current headquarters building. On June 2, 2016, Southwest broke ground on its new office and training facility known as Wings. The newest addition to the corporate campus is composed of a 420,000-square-foot, six-story office building, and a 380,000-square-foot adjoining structure called the Leadership Education and Aircrew Development (LEAD) Center that serves as the new pilot training facility. The LEAD Center has the capacity to house and support 18 flight simulators. It is designed to be expanded to accommodate up to 26 simulator bays. The building opened on April 3, 2018. [11] On August 16, 2019, Southwest announced an expansion of the LEAD Center to accommodate eight additional simulators for future operational and training demands. [12] On January 2, 2020, it was announced that Southwest would be purchasing an additional 3 acres (1.2 ha) of land adjacent to its Wings and LEAD facilities. [13] No additional details were disclosed. Employment As of January ', '["clm_wiki_southwest-airlines_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
