  ('cs_fedex_overview', 'org_fedex', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'FedEx Corporation, originally known as Federal Express Corporation, is an American multinational conglomerate holding company specializing in transportation, e-commerce, and business services. The company is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee. The name "FedEx" is a syllabic abbreviation of its original air division, Federal Express, which operated under this name from 1973 until 1994.', '["clm_wiki_fedex_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
