  ('cs_conagra-brands_overview', 'org_conagra-brands', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Conagra Brands, Inc. is an American consumer packaged goods holding company that makes and sells products under various brand names that are available in supermarkets, restaurants, and food service establishments. Based on its 2021 revenue, the company ranked 331st on the 2022 Fortune 500. Headquartered in Chicago, Illinois, Conagra was founded in Nebraska in 1919 and was originally called Nebraska Consolidated Mills.', '["clm_wiki_conagra-brands_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
