ace temp. min mean max −110 °C [17] −60 °C [18] 35 °C [17] Surface absorbed dose rate 8.8 μGy/h [19] Surface equivalent dose rate 27 μSv/h [19] Apparent magnitude −2.94 to +1.86 [20] Absolute magnitude (H) −1.5 [21] Angular diameter 3.5–25.1 arcseconds [2] Atmosphere [2] [22] Surface pressure 0.636 (0.4–0.87) kPa 0.00628 atm Composition by volume 95.97% carbon dioxide 1.93% argon 1.89% nitrogen 0.146% oxygen 0.0557% carbon monoxide 0.0210% water vapor body 2022 body 2022 Mars is the fourth planet fro', '["clm_wiki_mars_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
