   'H-E-B Grocery Company, LP, is an American privately held supermarket chain based in San Antonio, Texas, with more than 435 stores throughout Texas and Mexico. The company also operates Central Market, an upscale organic and fine foods retailer.', '["clm_wiki_h-e-b_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
