VALUES
  ('cs_reyes_leadership', 'org_reyes', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Beer distribution Reyes Beverage Group is the largest beer distribution organization in the United States, [1] representing import, craft , and domestic beer brands. The beer distribution operations within Reyes Holdings, LLC, are collectively known as Reyes Beverage Group, distributing over 272 million cases of beer to over 100,000 customers annually. The beer distribution operations within Reyes Beverage Group are: [2] [3] Chicago Beverage Systems, in Chicago, Illinois Premium Distributors of Virginia, in Chantilly, Virginia Harbor Distributing Co., in Huntington Beach Gardena , Santa Fe Springs, California Premium Distributors, of Washington, D.C. Lee Distributors, in Charleston, South Carolina Premium Distributors, of Maryland in Frederick, Maryland Gate City Beverage, in San Bernardino, California Crest Beverage, in San Diego, California Florida Distributing Company, in Orlando, Florida Chesbay Distributing, in Chesapeake, Virginia Windy City Distributing, in Warrenville, Illinois Allied Beverage, in Sylmar, California Gold Coast Distributing, in Miami, Florida Golden Brands, in northern California High Desert Distributing, in Bakersfield, California , Lancaster, California and Victorville, California Monarch Distributing, in Indianapolis, Indiana Greenco Distributing, in Greenville, South Carolina Premium Distributors, of Michigan DET Beverages, in Nashville, Tennessee Capital Reyes, in Manor, Texas Island Distributing in Hawaii Reyes Beverage Group features brands from Constellation Brands , MillerCoors , Boston Beer Company , Heineken Brands , the Lagunitas Brewing Company , Yuengling , and many more brands. [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Sazerac Shakes Up Distribution, Departing RNDC Across Two Dozen States" . Shanken News Daily . January 3, 2023 . Retrieved February 10, 2023 . ^ "Reyes Beverage Group" . www . Retrieved May 23, 2016 . ^ "Reyes Beer Division - Our Distributors" . reyesbeerdivision . Retrieved August 17, 2022 . ^ "Reyes Beer Division - Brands" . r', '["clm_wiki_reyes_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
