VALUES
  ('cs_reyes_operations', 'org_reyes', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'American foodservice wholesaler and distributor Reyes Holdings, LLC Type Private Industry Food Wholesale and Distribution Founded 1976 &#59;&#32;50 years ago ( 1976 ) in Spartanburg, South Carolina. Founder J. Christopher Reyes Jude Reyes Headquarters Rosemont, Illinois , United States Revenue $40 billion Website reyesholdings Reyes Holdings, LLC is an American food and beverage distributor and bottler [1] that ranks as the 6th largest privately held company in the United States, with annual sales in excess of US$40 billion. [2] Operations span 18 countries in North, Central, and South America, as well as Europe, the Middle East, and Asia Pacific. [3] Reyes Holdings subdivisions include Reyes Beverage Group, the largest beer distributor in the United States, Martin Brower, McDonald''s largest global distributor, and Reyes Coca-Cola Bottling, a Midwest and West Coast bottler and distributor. The company is based in Rosemont, Illinois , a suburb of Chicago . ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Reyes Coca-Cola - Home" . reyescocacola . Retrieved February 10, 2023 . ^ "Reyes Holdings - About" . Reyes Holdings - About . Retrieved February 10, 2023 . ^ "Reyes Holdings - About" . Reyes Holdings - About . Retrieved December 6, 2025 .', '["clm_wiki_reyes_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
