  ('cs_newell-brands_overview', 'org_newell-brands', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Newell Brands Inc. is an American conglomerate of consumer and commercial products. The company''s brands and products include Rubbermaid storage/or waste disposal containers; home organization and reusable container products; Contigo and Bubba water bottles; Coleman outdoor products; writing instruments glue ; children''s products ; cookware and small appliances and fragrance products.', '["clm_wiki_newell-brands_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
