  ('cs_hanesbrands_overview', 'org_hanesbrands', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Hanesbrands Inc. is an American multinational clothing company based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina. Employing 65,300 people internationally, it owns several clothing brands, including Hanes, Playtex, Bali, L''eggs, Just My Size, Barely There, Wonderbra, Maidenform, Berlei, and Bonds. The company was acquired by Gildan in 2025.', '["clm_wiki_hanesbrands_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
