ody:not( ):not( ) "Company Overview of Airbnb, Inc" . Bloomberg L.P. Archived from the original on January 8, 2018. ^ "Nathan Blecharczyk" . Forbes . Archived from the original on April 13, 2019 . Retrieved April 11, 2019 . ^ "Airbnb, Inc. 2025 Form 10-K Annual Report" . United States Securities and Exchange Commission . February 12, 2026 . Retrieved February 24, 2026 . ^ "Airbnb, Inc. Form 14-A Proxy Statement" . United States Securities and Exchange Commission . April 14, 2026. ^ Friedman, Thomas ', '["clm_wiki_airbnb_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
