  ('cs_workiva_leadership', 'org_workiva', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Early history 2008 - 2014 In August 2008, Workiva Inc. was formed as WebFilings LLC in California by Jerry Behar and a team of five other entrepreneurs. [1] Martin Vanderploeg was a co-founder of EAI and served as CTO and Executive Vice President until they were acquired in 2000 by UGS Corp , [2] [3] [4] and is now a division of Siemens , the German technology multinational. [5] The Workiva Platform is a cloud-based enterprise software-as-a-service platform that enables companies to collect, manage, report and analyse critical business data in real time. [6] Wdesk also allows companies to manage and file financial and compliance documents to regulatory agencies. [7] Workiva integrates information from disparate content formats, including spreadsheets, presentation documents, emails and other unstructured data , into a single cloud-based report. [8] [9] In July 2014, the company changed its name to Workiva LLC. [10] [11] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "ChartEXE: Market Data Aggregation Service" . ChartEXE: Market Data Aggregation Service . Retrieved 2020-11-20 . ^ "SEC TENDER OFFER STATEMENT (c57319scto-c )" . SEC . Security and Exchange Commission. September 5, 2000. ^ "Martin J. Vanderploeg Ph.D. - Executive Bio, Work History, and Contacts - Equilar BoardEdge" . people . Archived from the original on 2019-03-22 . Retrieved 2019-03-22 . ^ "Person" . Bloomberg . ^ Cite error: The named reference auto was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ "Workiva Analytics" . Reuters . 17 October 2014. ^ "Workiva Announces 2019 Partner Award Winners at Amplify User Conference | Financial Post" . Financial Post . 2019-09-09 . Retrieved 2019-09-13 . ^ Van Decker, John E.; Iervolino, Christopher (May 2016). "Magic Quadrant for Financial Corporate Performance Management Solutions" . Gartner . Retrieved 28 September 2016 . ^ Kugel, Robert (July 2016). "Workiva Automates Composite Documents with Workiva" . Ventana Research . Retrieved 1 November 2016 . ^ "WebFilings changes name to W', '["clm_wiki_workiva_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
