  ('cs_zscaler_operations', 'org_zscaler', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Acquisitions Zscaler acquired the AI and machine-learning technology of TrustPath in August 2018; the browser security company Appsulate for $13 million in May 2019; cloud security posture management startup Cloudneeti in April 2020; and microsegmentation firm Edgewise Networks in May 2020. [1] The company purchased cybersecurity startup Trustdome in April 2021; [2] Indian cybersecurity startup Smokescreen Technologies in May 2021; [3] and cloud security firm ShiftRight for $25.6 million in September 2022. [4] On February 14, 2023, Zscaler announced it would acquire Israeli application security company Canonic, a company focused on protecting against attacks that target software as a service. [5] In March 2024, the company acquired Israel-based data security startup Avalor, which uses AI to analyze data in search of identifying security vulnerabilities, for $310 million; [6] and network segmentation startup Airgap Network, for an undisclosed amount. [7] On May 17, 2025, Zscaler announced it would acquire Red Canary for an undisclosed amount. Red Canary is a US based provider of Managed Detection and Response services. [8] In February 2026, the company announced it the acquisition of browser security company SquareX for an undisclosed amount. [9] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Zscaler Buys Application Security Startup Edgewise Networks" . crn . Retrieved August 15, 2024 . ^ "Zscaler Buys Startup Trustdome To Control Cloud Permissions" . crn . Retrieved August 15, 2024 . ^ "Zscaler acquires Mumbai-based cybersecurity startup Smokescreen Technologies" . economictimes . Retrieved August 15, 2024 . ^ "Zscaler Acquires ShiftRight To Boost Its Cloud Security Offerings" . crn . Retrieved August 15, 2024 . ^ "Zscaler To Acquire Canonic Security To Thwart SaaS Attacks" . crn . Retrieved August 15, 2024 . ^ Roof, Katie (March 14, 2024). "Zscaler Buys Israeli AI-Enhanced Data Security Startup Avalor" . Bloomberg News . ^ Alspach, Kyle (April 11, 2024). "Zscaler To Acquire Network Segmen', '["clm_wiki_zscaler_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
-- 163. Cloudflare (slug=cloudflare, wiki='Cloudflare')
