VALUES
  ('cs_lucid-motors_operations', 'org_lucid-motors', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Vehicles Lucid mainly developed battery technology in its early years, but began development of its first car in 2014. The company initially used a Mercedes Metris van named "Edna", to develop the powertrain . [1] [2] Lucid Air Main article: Lucid Air Lucid Air Electric Drive Unit and the Lucid Air Battery A prototype of the Lucid Air fully electric car was unveiled in December 2016. Lucid Air production was expected to start in spring 2021. [3] In November 2020, The Lucid Air Pure was announced with 406 mi (653 km) of projected range and 480 hp (360 kW) and a starting price of US$77,400. The full range of models includes Lucid Air Touring, Grand Touring, and Dream Edition versions. The top-spec cars have an output of over 1,000 hp (750 kW). [4] On September 16, 2020, the US Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) rated the range of the Lucid Air at 520 miles (840 km) on a single charge. [5] [6] Lucid has agreed with Mobileye to use their EyeQ4 chips and eight cameras for driver assist features, [7] and will make the car "autonomous ready". [8] The 4-door sedan is able to reach a software-limited top speed of 217 mph (349 km/h). [9] In July 2017, while running on the high-speed track at the Transportation Research Center in Ohio a special version of the car (with the speed limiter disabled via software and other modifications) hit 235 mph (378 km/h). [9] Lucid is collaborating with Amazon to include Amazon''s Alexa voice assistant, allowing drivers to use the voice assistant for navigation, phone calls, media streaming, smart home control, and other activities while driving. [10] The infotainment system is based on Android Automotive . [11] The character of Samantha Margolis uses a Lucid Air in several episodes of season four of the Amazon Studios TV series Goliath . [12] In September 2021, Lucid released the EPA estimated range for both the Dream Edition Air and Air Grand Touring; the Dream Air had a range of 520 miles on a single charge while the Grand Touring offere', '["clm_wiki_lucid-motors_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
