VALUES
  ('cs_general-atomics_operations', 'org_general-atomics', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Leadership General Atomics is led by chairman and CEO Neal Blue and his brother, Linden Blue . [1] Linden P. Blue is the chief executive officer of General Atomics Aeronautical Systems (GA-ASI), the division responsible for manufacturing and selling the Reaper UAV . [2] Dave R. Alexander is the President of GA-ASI. [3] Scott Forney is the President of General Atomics Electromagnetic Systems (GA-EMS). [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) General Atomics Corporation. "Neal Blue" . Neal Blue . Retrieved 1 December 2023 . ^ "Linden P. Blue" . International Institute for Strategic Studies . Retrieved 1 December 2023 . ^ "David R. Alexander Bio – AmCham Abu Dhabi" . AmChamAbuDhabi . Retrieved 1 December 2023 . ^ "Scott Forney" . World Utilities Congress . Retrieved 1 December 2023 . &#91; permanent dead link &#93;', '["clm_wiki_general-atomics_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
