  ('cs_taylor-morrison-home_overview', 'org_taylor-morrison-home', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Taylor Morrison Home Corporation is one of the largest home building companies in the United States. Its corporate headquarters are in Scottsdale, Arizona. The company formed when Taylor Woodrow and Morrison Homes joined forces in July 2007. Taylor Morrison operates in twelve states building entry-level to higher-end homes, both for sale and for rent. They also build resort-style communities under the Esplanade brand and build-to-rent communities, both apartments and single family homes, under the Yardly brand.', '["clm_wiki_taylor-morrison-home_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
