  ('cs_mgm-resorts_overview', 'org_mgm-resorts', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'MGM Resorts International is an American multinational hospitality, sports and entertainment company. It operates resorts in Las Vegas, Massachusetts, Michigan, Mississippi, Maryland, Ohio, New Jersey, Macau, Shanghai, Chengdu, Hangzhou and Sanya, including the Bellagio, Mandalay Bay, MGM Grand and Park MGM.', '["clm_wiki_mgm-resorts_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
