   '1993: Consolidation and founding of Charter Communications, Inc. Through continued mergers and acquisition, Charter was consolidated in 1993 by Barry Babcock, Jerald Kent and Howard Wood, who had been former executives at Cencom Cable Television in St. Louis, Missouri. It was also incorporated in the state of Missouri in 1993. [1] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Staff (undated). "Company History for Charter Communications, Inc" . fundinguniverse . Archived from the original on May 27, 2015 . Retrieved May 28, 2015 .', '["clm_wiki_charter-communications_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
