   'DISH Network LLC, often referred to as Dish, an abbreviation for Digital Sky Highway, formerly EchoStar Communications Corporation and DISH Network Corporation, is an American provider of satellite television and IPTV services and wholly owned subsidiary of EchoStar Corporation. Its primary competitors are DirecTV.', '["clm_wiki_dish-network_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
