  ('cs_coty_overview', 'org_coty', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Coty Inc. is a multinational beauty company founded in Paris in 1904 by François Coty. Today, the company is incorporated in Delaware, United States, with its global headquarters in Amsterdam, Netherlands. With its subsidiaries, it develops, manufactures, markets, and distributes fragrances, cosmetics, skin care, nail care, and both professional and retail hair care products. Coty owns around 40 brands as of 2024.', '["clm_wiki_coty_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
