  ('cs_coty_leadership', 'org_coty', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Brands and products Coty owns approximately 40 brands, as of 2024, and has partnerships with various other brands, including: [1] [2] Adidas [3] Bourjois [4] Beyoncé Bruno Banani [5] Burberry [6] Calvin Klein Chloé [1] David Beckham Davidoff Dolce &amp; Gabbana Escada [5] Gabriela Sabatini Gucci Hugo Boss [5] James Bond (007 James Bond) [5] Jil Sander [7] JOOP! Jōvan Musk Katy Perry Kylie Cosmetics (51%) KKW Beauty (20%) [8] Lacoste (fragrances) until end of 2023. Now Licensed by Interparfums from 1 Jan 2024 [5] Lancaster Marc Jacobs [9] Marni Max Factor [9] Mexx [5] Miu Miu [10] Monange Nautica Orveda philosophy Rimmel [11] Roberto Cavalli [12] Sally Hansen [13] Skkn By Kim Tiffany &amp; Co [14] Vera Wang Wella Coty relaunched the CoverGirl and Clairol brands, including the Nice ''n Easy hair coloring product, in late 2017 and early 2018, respectively. The relaunches included new messaging and product development, with an emphasis on diversity. [11] [15] [16] The company also relaunched Max Factor in 2018. [17] [18] [19] ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) Toplensky, Rochelle (December 6, 2017). "ECJ rules in favour of Coty over online sales ban" . Financial Times . Retrieved April 24, 2018 . ^ "All Brands - Coty" . www . Retrieved 2024-02-06 . ^ "Adidas Perfumes And Colognes" . fragantica . Retrieved 10 May 2022 . ^ Jowett, Victoria (January 17, 2018). "The Amazon Alexa can now give you beauty advice" . Cosmopolitan . Hearst Communications. ISSN 0010-9541 . Retrieved April 27, 2018 . ^ a b c d e f Brunsman, Barrett J. (January 12, 2016). "P&amp;G''s multibillion-dollar deal with Coty just got smaller" . Cincinnati Business Courier . American City Business Journals . Retrieved May 8, 2018 . ^ Daneshkhu, Scheherazade (February 8, 2018). "Coty shares shine as P&amp;G acquisitions begin to pay off" . Financial Times . Retrieved April 27, 2018 . ^ Weil, Jennifer (August 10, 2007). "A New Man for Jil Sander" . Women''s Wear Daily . Retrieved May 8, 2018 . ^ Cite error: The named refe', '["clm_wiki_coty_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
