VALUES
  ('cs_ulta-beauty_leadership', 'org_ulta-beauty', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Corporate governance George left Ulta in 1995, and Hanson became the company''s chief executive officer (CEO). [1] In December 1999, Lyn Kirby became the president and CEO and Charles "Rick" Weber became senior executive vice president, chief operating officer (COO) and Chief Financial Officer (CFO). In 2010, Carl "Chuck" Rubin was appointed as chief operating officer, president, and as a member of the board of directors. [2] On June 24, 2013, it was announced that Mary Dillon would be appointed as CEO and a member of the board of directors, effective July 1, 2013. [3] Dillon was previously the chief of U.S. Cellular and a senior executive at McDonald''s and PepsiCo . [4] On January 6th, 2025, Dave Kimbell announced his retirement as CEO of Ulta Beauty effective immediately. Dave Kimbell was succeeded as CEO by Kecia Steelman , who was previously the company’s chief operating officer. [5] The same month, Amiee Bayer-Thomas was named chief retail officer. [6] In June of the same year, Chis Lialios was appointed as chief financial officer (CFO). Also in June 2025, Lauren Brindley was named chief merchandising and digital officer. [7] ^ Cite error: The named reference IDCH was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ body:not( ):not( ) Tribune, Chicago. "Chicago''s $10 million CEOs" . Chicago Tribune . &#91; date missing &#93; ^ "Mary Dillon leaves U.S. Cellular to become CEO of Ulta" . Crain''s Chicago Business . June 24, 2013 . Retrieved July 12, 2019 . ^ "Ulta Beauty Names Mary Dillion Chief Executive Officer" . Yahoo! Finance . ^ Lebsack, Lexy (2025-12-11). "Ulta Beauty CEO Kecia Steelman unpacks her first year in charge and 2026 goals, plus news" . Glossy . Retrieved 2026-02-17 . ^ DCFmodeling. "Ulta Beauty, Inc. (ULTA): History, Ownership, Mission, How It Works &amp; Makes Money" . AI-Powered Discounted Cash Flow Editable Templates . Retrieved 2026-02-17 . ^ DCFmodeling. "Ulta Beauty, Inc. (ULTA): History, Ownership, Mission, How It Works &amp; Makes Money" ', '["clm_wiki_ulta-beauty_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
