   'Duke Energy Corporation is an American electric power and natural gas holding company headquartered in Charlotte, North Carolina. The company serves over 7 million customers in the eastern United States. In 2024, it ranked as the 141st largest company in the United States, its highest-ever placement on the Fortune 500 list.', '["clm_wiki_duke-energy_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
