  ('cs_southern_leadership', 'org_southern', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Governance Board of directors Christopher C. Womack – Chairman of the Board, President and CEO [1] Janaki Akella Shantella E Cooper David J. Grain Donald M. James John D. Johns Executive management Christopher C. Womack – Chairman of the Board, President and CEO [2] Bryan Anderson – Executive Vice President and President of External Affairs David P. Poroch – Executive Vice President and CFO Stan W. Connally, Jr. – Executive Vice President and COO Chris Cummiskey – Executive Vice President and CCO Martin B. Davis – Executive Vice President and CIO Sloane Drake – Executive Vice President and CHRO ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Southern Company - Corporate Governance - Board of Directors" . investor . Retrieved February 3, 2025 . ^ "Southern Company - Corporate Governance - Company Leadership" . investor . Retrieved February 3, 2025 .', '["clm_wiki_southern_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
