VALUES
  ('cs_lyondellbasell_history', 'org_lyondellbasell', 'overview', 'History',
   'Netherlands-incorporated chemical company LyondellBasell Industries N.V. Type Public Traded as NYSE : LYB S&amp;P 500 component ISIN NL0009434992 Industry Chemicals Predecessor Basell Polyolefins Lyondell Chemical Company ARCO Chemical Founded December 2007 &#59;&#32;18 years ago ( 2007-12 ) Headquarters Houston , Texas, United States and London , UK; Rotterdam , Netherlands (legal domicile) Key people Peter Vanacker ( CEO ) Michael McMurray ( CFO ) Jeffrey Kaplan ( CLO ) Products Chemicals, Polymers Revenue US$ 40.3 billion (2024) Operating income US$1.82 billion (2024) Net income US$1.36 billion (2024) Total assets US$35.7 billion (2024) Total equity US$12.5 billion (2024) Number of employees 20,000 (2024) Website lyondellbasell Footnotes [1] [2] LyondellBasell Industries N.V. is an American multinational chemical company, incorporated in the Netherlands with U.S. operations headquartered in Houston , Texas and offices in London , UK . The company is the largest licensor of polyethylene and polypropylene technologies. [3] [4] It also produces ethylene , propylene , polyolefins , and oxyfuels. [5] [6] LyondellBasell was formed in December 2007 by the acquisition of Lyondell Chemical Company by Basell Polyolefins for $12.7 billion. [7] As of 2016, Lyondell was the third largest independent chemical manufacturer in the United States. [8] LyondellBasell''s global headquarters is located in Williams Tower in Houston, Texas. [9] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Investors" . ^ "US SEC: Form 10-K LyondellBasell Industries N.V." U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission . 27 February 2025. ^ "Orpic picks LyondellBasell PP technology at new plant in Oman" . www (in Russian) . Retrieved 2018-03-27 . ^ "Orpic picks LyondellBasell PP technology at new plant in Oman" . www (in Russian). Archived from the original on 2019-09-15 . Retrieved 2026-08-08 . ^ Newton, Jennifer (2017-07-28). "LyondellBasell to build world''s largest propylene oxide plant" . Chemistry World . Retrieved 2026-08-08 . ^ "LyondellBasell Industries N.V.: Private Company Information - Bloomberg" . www . Retrieved 2018-03-27 . ^ "Who We Are" . LyondellBasell . Retrieved 2018-03-27 . ^ John, Abbink (2016-01-27). "LyondellBasell: Misunderstood and Undervalued" . MySA . Retrieved 2026-08-08 . ^ "Houston | LyondellBasell" . www . Retrieved 2025-08-04 .', '["clm_wiki_lyondellbasell_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   20, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
