VALUES
  ('cs_jabil_leadership', 'org_jabil', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Acquisitions and mergers Jabil has acquired numerous companies and arms of companies. Their acquisitions have expanded their presence in countries such as China, Mexico, India, Spain, the Netherlands and Russia. [1] [2] In 1999, Jabil began its operations in China by acquiring GET Manufacturing. [3] [4] [5] In 2001, Jabil expanded its manufacturing capability and acquired Intel''s manufacturing facility in Malaysia. [6] A year later, the company acquired a factory of Lucent Technologies in Shanghai. [7] [8] In 2002, the company also acquired contract manufacturing services of Philips. [9] [10] [11] In 2005, Jabil acquired Varian''s electronics manufacturing business for $195 million. [12] [13] [14] A year later, Jabil expanded its operations to Taiwan and acquired Green Point for $881 million through its subsidiary Jabil Circuit Taiwan. [15] [16] In 2011, Jabil acquired Telmar Network, a communication network service provider based in Texas. [17] [18] In February 2013, Jabil acquired Nypro for $665 million in cash. [19] The purchase was completed in July 2013. [20] [21] [22] In 2015, Jabil acquired Shemer Group, an Israeli metal fabrication company specializing in contract manufacturing for high-tech capital equipment manufacturers. [23] [24] In the same year, the company acquired Plasticos Castella, a Spain-based food and consumer packaging manufacturer. [25] In 2018, Jabil acquired the medical devices business of Johnson &amp; Johnson . [26] [27] In 2021, Jabil acquired Ecologic Brands. [28] In August 2023, Jabil sold its mobility business in China to BYD . [28] In November 2023, Jabil acquired the Silicon Photonics business of Intel. [29] [30] In November 2023, Jabil acquired ProcureAbility . [31] In January 2026, it was announced that Jabil had acquired Hanley Energy Group, a provider of energy management and critical power systems for data centre infrastructure. The all-cash transaction, completed on 2 January 2026, was valued at approximately $725 million, with ', '["clm_wiki_jabil_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
