  ('cs_avnet_operations', 'org_avnet', 'overview', 'Operations',
   '1930–1940 During World War II , Avnet made antennas for the U.S. armed forces. Charles''s son, Lester, joined the business at that time. [1] After the war was over, Avnet focused on buying and selling surplus electronic and electrical parts. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Avnet''s History --Family beginnings" . Avnet . Retrieved December 14, 2007 .', '["clm_wiki_avnet_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
