VALUES
  ('cs_wesco_leadership', 'org_wesco', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Acquisitions In 2005, Wesco acquired the Carlton-Bates Company, a provider of original equipment products and supply solutions &#91; buzzword &#93; to industrial customers. [1] In the same year, Forbes magazine named Wesco as one of their 400 Best Big Companies, an honor which was received again in 2006, 2007, and 2009. [1] In 2006, Wesco acquired the Communication Supply Corporation, a national distributor of data communications products for enterprise and data center customers. [2] In November 2010 the company acquired TVC Communications. [3] [4] In 2010, Wesco acquired Calgary , Alberta based Brews Supply Ltd. [5] In 2012, Wesco acquired EECOL Electric Corp. [6] In June 2012, the company acquired Conney Safety Products, LLC. [7] In 2014, Wesco acquired Hazmasters Inc. [8] In 2015, Wesco acquired Hill Country Electric Supply, [9] Aelux, [10] and Needham Electric Supply. [11] In 2016, Wesco acquired Atlanta Electrical Distributors, LLC. [12] In 2019, Wesco acquired OSRAM ''s Sylvania Lighting Solutions (SLS), now known as Wesco Energy Solutions. [13] [14] On January 13, 2020, Wesco agreed to acquire Anixter . [15] In November 2021, Wesco changed its logo as part of the post-merger integration with Anixter. [16] On September 7, 2022, Wesco agreed to acquire Rahi Systems. [17] On December 6, 2024, Wesco acquired Ascent, LLC. [18] ^ a b Cite error: The named reference auto1 was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Datacom distributor WESCO International acquiring Communications Supply Corp" . Cabling Installation &amp; Maintenance . 2006-11-01 . Retrieved 2024-08-15 . ^ Cite error: The named reference tcommergers2010 was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ "WESCO International Acquires TVC Communications" . Industrial Distribution . 2010-11-17 . Retrieved 2024-08-15 . ^ "Wesco International Acquires Brews Supply" . Industrial Distribution . 2011-10-05 . Retrieved 2024-08-15 . ^ "WESCO International Completes $1.14B Acquisi', '["clm_wiki_wesco_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
