VALUES
  ('cs_henry-schein_leadership', 'org_henry-schein', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Operations Dental A Henry Schein syringe for dental use In 1997, Henry Schein acquired Sullivan Dental Products and Dentrix Dental Systems, making it the world''s largest distributor of dental equipment and supplies. [1] [2] Dentrix Ascend , is a cloud-based dental practice management software platform developed by Henry Schein One for dental offices. The software is accessible through a web browser and includes tools of scheduling, billing, patient records, imaging, and practice management. [3] [4] Henry Schein established the Henry Schein Dental Business Institute in March 2015 to teach owners and operators of dental practices the fundamentals of business. The first class to complete the program graduated in March 2016. [5] Henry Schein also launched the Henry Schein Digital Dentistry Program at Temple University''s Maurice H. Kornberg School of Dentistry in 2016. [6] In May 2016, Henry Schein''s entity Dentrix presented the DEXIS software''s ability to integrate X-rays into a patient''s chart. [7] Zahn Dental, Henry Schein''s laboratory supply business, acquired Custom Automated Prosthetics in June 2016. The acquisition enabled Henry Schein to expand its prosthetic offerings. [8] [9] [10] In August 2019, Henry Schein acquired a majority equity stake in Cliniclands, a distributor serving dental practices throughout Sweden, Denmark, and Norway. [11] In May 2021, Henry Schein announced it acquired an 80% ownership position in Jarvis Analytics, a software company that develops comprehensive data analytics tools for dental practitioners. [12] In June 2021, Henry Schein acquired a 70% ownership position in eAssist Dental Solutions (eAssist), the developer of a virtual dental billing outsourcing service. [13] In August 2022, Henry Schein acquired Midway Dental Supply, a full-service dental distributor serving across the Midwestern United States. [14] In January 2023, Henry Schein announced its subsidiary, eAssist Dental Solutions (eAssist), acquired a majority interest in Uni', '["clm_wiki_henry-schein_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
