VALUES
  ('cs_henry-schein_operations', 'org_henry-schein', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'History In 1932, Henry Schein, a graduate of Columbia University College of Pharmacy, borrowed $500 and opened a pharmacy in Queens, New York . [1] [2] The company expanded into dental supplies in the 1960s, and by the late 1980s, Henry Schein held approximately 10 percent of the dental-supply market. Marvin Schein, Henry Schein''s son, took over management of daily operations in 1971. [3] In 1978, founder Henry Schein''s son Jay Schein became CEO of the company. [1] When Jay Schein died of cancer in 1989, Stanley Bergman took over as CEO. [1] [2] Bergman was born in South Africa and came to New York in 1976, where he became an accountant. In 1980, he joined Henry Schein and was promoted to CFO . [1] [4] Henry Schein Inc. filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in 1995 to sell 6.2 million shares in an initial public offering with William Blair &amp; Company as the lead underwriter. [5] The IPO raised $72.8 million and began trading on the Nasdaq. [2] [3] By 1996, the company was up to $1.4 billion in sales and $29 million in profit under Bergman''s leadership. That year, the company made seventeen acquisitions. [3] In August 1997, Henry Schein Inc. agreed to buy Sullivan Dental Products Inc. for approximately $318 million. The purchase made the company the world''s largest distributor of dental equipment and supplies. By that point, Henry Schein had made 16 acquisitions in 1997. Also in 1997, Henry Schein acquired New York-based medical-products distributor Micro BioMedics Inc [6] as well as Dentrix Dental Systems. [3] Henry Schein announced the acquisition of demedis GmbH and Euro Dental Holding GmbH in June 2004. [7] In November 2009, it was announced that Henry Schein Inc. and Butler Animal Health Supply would be launching joint venture Butler Schein Animal Health, the largest veterinary sales and distribution company in the United States. [8] Butler Schein Animal Health was rebranded as Henry Schein Animal Health in 2013. [9] Between 1989 and 2016, He', '["clm_wiki_henry-schein_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
