  ('cs_sysco_overview', 'org_sysco', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Sysco is an American multinational corporation that sells, markets, and distributes food products to restaurants, healthcare and educational facilities, sports stadiums, and other venues that serve food. It also sells foodservice supplies and equipment. The company is headquartered in the Energy Corridor district of Houston, Texas.', '["clm_wiki_sysco_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
