  ('cs_chs_overview', 'org_chs', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'CHS Inc. is a Fortune 500 secondary cooperative owned by United States agricultural cooperatives, farmers, ranchers, and thousands of preferred stock holders. Based in Inver Grove Heights, Minnesota, CHS owns and operates various food processing and wholesale, farm supply, financial services and retail businesses. It also distributes Cenex brand fuel in 19 midwestern and western states as one of North America''s largest c-store networks. It is a co-owner of Ventura Foods, a vegetable oil processor.', '["clm_wiki_chs_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
