024 . ^ "Texas Roadhouse, Inc. Common Stock (TXRH) Financials" . Nasdaq. September 10, 2024 . Retrieved September 10, 2024 . ^ a b c d e "US SEC: Form 10-K Texas Roadhouse, Inc" . United States Securities and Exchange Commission . Retrieved January 9, 2017 . ^ "Texas Roadhouse (TXRH) shares forming bullish "flag" pattern" . BloggingStocks. November 15, 2007. Archived from the original on March 27, 2019 . Retrieved June 24, 2011 . ^ "Texas Roadhouse Inc - About Texas Roadhouse Inc" . Reuters . 2019 . Re', '["clm_wiki_texas-roadhouse_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
