VALUES
  ('cs_five-guys_history', 'org_five-guys', 'overview', 'History',
   'American fast food chain Not to be confused with Just 5 Guys . Five Guys Enterprises, LLC Five Guys in Merritt Island, Florida Trade name Five Guys Type Private Industry Restaurant Genre Fast food Founded 1986 &#59;&#32;40 years ago ( 1986 ) Arlington, Virginia , United States Founders Jerry Murrell, Janie Murrell [1] Headquarters Alexandria, Virginia , United States Number of locations 1,700+ [2] (2021) Area served List Australia [3] Austria [4] Bahrain Belgium Canada China Czech Republic [5] France Germany Hong Kong Republic of Ireland Kuwait Netherlands [6] Italy [7] Luxembourg Macau Malaysia [8] Qatar Saudi Arabia Singapore [9] South Korea [10] Spain Sweden Switzerland United Arab Emirates United Kingdom United States Key people Jerry Murrell, Jim Murrell, Matt Murrell, Chad Murrell, Ben Murrell, Tyler Murrell [11] Products Hamburgers , french fries , hot dogs , soft drinks , milkshakes Revenue US$ 2.347 billion [12] (2023) Owner Murrell family Number of employees 5,000 [13] (2021) Website fiveguys Five Guys Enterprises, LLC ( doing business as Five Guys Burgers and Fries and Five Guys ) is an American multinational fast food chain focused on hamburgers , hot dogs , and french fries . It is headquartered in Alexandria, Virginia . [14] [15] The first Five Guys restaurant opened in 1986 in Arlington County, Virginia . By 2001, there were five locations in the Washington, D.C. , metro area. [2] In early 2003, Five Guys began franchising , beginning a period of rapid expansion. In a year and a half, permits had been sold for over 300 franchised locations. [2] As of 2026 &#91;update&#93; , Five Guys had over 1,900 locations open worldwide. It was the fastest-growing fast food chain in the United States, with a 32.8% sales increase from 2010 to 2011. [16] ^ Cite error: The named reference biggerbite was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ a b c body:not( ):not( ) "Five Guys Story" . Five Guys . January 20, 2022 . Retrieved January 20, 2022 . ^ "Five Guys to open in Penrith on Monday morning" . Western Weekender . September 16, 2021 . Retrieved September 20, 2021 . ^ "Five Guys: Was am neuen Burgerhype in Wien dran ist" . Der Standard . January 30, 2021 . Retrieved January 31, 2022 . ^ "First in the Czech Republic: Five Guys Opens Monday at Shopping Centre Máj in Prague" . PragueDaily News . December 7, 2025 . Retrieved December 8, 2025 . ^ "Five Guys opent in Eindhoven" . Eindhovens Dagblad . December 11, 2017 . Retrieved June 14, 2021 . ^ "Non', '["clm_wiki_five-guys_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   20, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
  (id, entity_id, section_type, heading, body_markdown, claim_ids, source_ids,
