  ('cs_ollies-bargain-outlet_history', 'org_ollies-bargain-outlet', 'overview', 'History',
   'American discount retail store "Ollie''s" redirects here. For other uses, see Ollie (disambiguation) . Ollie''s Bargain Outlet Holdings, Inc. An Ollie''s Bargain Outlet in Woonsocket, Rhode Island Trade name Ollie''s Bargain Outlet Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : OLLI S&amp;P 400 component Industry Discount retail Founded July 29, 1982 &#59;&#32;44 years ago ( July 29, 1982 ) in Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania Founders Mort Bernstein Harry Coverman Mark Butler Oliver "Ollie" Rosenberg Headquarters Harrisburg, Pennsylvania , U.S. Number of locations 618 [1] Area served United States Key people Eric van der Valk ( president , CEO ) Chris Zender ( executive vice president , COO ) James Comitale (General counsel, senior vice president ) Kevin McLain ( senior vice president , general merchandise manager ) Rob Helm ( executive vice president , CFO ) Larry Kraus ( CIO ) [2] Products Gifts, housewares, food, flooring, books, toys, hardware, electronics, clothing, lawn and garden, health and beauty, sporting goods, pet supplies, automotive, seasonal Brands Various Revenue US$ 2.102 billion (2024) Number of employees 12,792 [1] (2025) Website www Ollie''s Bargain Outlet is an American discount store chain. It was founded in Mechanicsburg, Pennsylvania , in 1982 by Morton Bernstein, Mark Butler, Harry Coverman, and Oliver "Ollie" Rosenberg, the company''s namesake. As of September 2025 &#91;update&#93; , the chain has 618 locations in 34 states. Its selection of merchandise comprises a variety of discounted items, mostly overstock or closeout merchandise that is purchased in bulk from other retailers and sold at discounted prices. Ollie''s Bargain Outlet stores feature advertisements and signage with caricatures of Rosenberg, and the chain''s slogan "good stuff cheap." ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) "Investor FAQs Ollie''s Bargain Outlet Holdings Inc" . Ollie''s. Archived from the original on September 18, 2025 . Retrieved 2025-09-15 . ^ "Management Team" . Ollie''s Bargain Outlet Holdings Inc. Archived from the original on September 25, 2021 . Retrieved April 15, 2024 .', '["clm_wiki_ollies-bargain-outlet_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   20, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
