tronic Data Gathering, Analysis, and Retrieval . U.S. Securities &amp; Exchange Commission . January 29, 2023. Principal Shareholders and Stock Ownership by Management (sec.). Archived from the original on May 5, 2023 . Retrieved Feb 5, 2026 . ^ "Olympics outfitter Lululemon accused of greenwashing in France" . Green News (sec.). Euronews . July 25, 2024. Archived from the original on Sep 27, 2024 . Retrieved Feb 28, 2025 . ^ "Canadian Brand Lululemon Opens Massive London Flagship" . Retail &amp; Le', '["clm_wiki_lululemon_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
