  ('cs_maytag_history', 'org_maytag', 'overview', 'History',
   'American home and commercial appliance brand For other uses, see Maytag (disambiguation) . Maytag Corporation Type Subsidiary Founded 1893 &#59;&#32;133 years ago ( 1893 ) (as Maytag Washing Machine Company) Newton, Iowa , U.S. Products Appliances Revenue US$ 4.7 billion Number of employees 2,500 Parent Whirlpool Corporation (2006–present) Subsidiaries See § Owned brands Website www The Maytag Corporation is an American home and commercial appliance company. The company has been owned by Whirlpool Corporation since April 2006.', '["clm_wiki_maytag_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
