   'Acquisitions In July 2021, Werner acquired regional truckload carriers ECM Transport Group (ECM Transport and Motor Carrier Service, LLC), expanding in the Mid-Atlantic, Ohio and Northeast regions. [1] In November 2021, Werner acquired final mile carrier NEHDS Logistics, LLC. [2] In October 2022, Werner acquired truckload carrier Baylor Trucking, Inc., expanding in the east central and south-central U.S. truckload markets. [3] In November 2022, Werner acquired asset-light logistics provider and truckload carrier, ReedTMS Logistics. [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Werner acquires regional carriers in $142M deal with ECM Transport Group" . July 1, 2021. ^ "Werner grows final-mile platform through $64M acquisition of NEHDS" . November 29, 2021. ^ "Werner Enterprises acquires Baylor Trucking" . October 3, 2022. ^ "Werner announces its acquisition of ReedTMS Logistics" . November 8, 2022.', '["clm_wiki_werner-enterprises_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
