VALUES
  ('cs_landstar-system_leadership', 'org_landstar-system', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Operations Landstar System is based in Jacksonville, Florida . [1] The company includes over 8,800 owner-operators in the United States, Canada and Mexico. The business capacity operators (BCOs) are not forced to dispatch like traditional trucking companies. Rather, they can choose their own loads. Landstar has agents in the United States and Canada. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Landstar System Corporate Office – Corporate Offices &amp; Headquarters" . Corporate Offices &amp; Headquarters . March 11, 2015 . Retrieved February 27, 2017 . ^ Landstar System: Success Without Employees - Forbes .', '["clm_wiki_landstar-system_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
