  ('cs_trane-technologies_history', 'org_trane-technologies', 'overview', 'History',
   'Awards &amp; Recognition Trane Technologies continues to receive global recognition for sustainability, innovation, culture, and ethics. Recent honors (2025–2026) include: [1] Fortune World’s Most Admired Companies (14 consecutive years) TIME World’s Best Companies TIME Most Sustainable Companies Corporate Knights Global 100 Most Sustainable Companies CDP Climate “A List” Ethisphere World’s Most Ethical Companies Forbes World’s Best Employers and America’s Best Employers for Women Financial Times Europe’s Climate Leaders (5 consecutive years) JUST 100 – Top 10 ranking in 2025 These recognitions highlight leadership in sustainability, ethical business practices, climate innovation, and workplace culture. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Business Awards &amp; Recognition" . www . Retrieved 23 March 2026 .', '["clm_wiki_trane-technologies_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
