   'Otis Worldwide Corporation, doing business as its former legal name Otis Elevator Company and styled as OTIS, is an American company that develops, manufactures and markets elevators, escalators, moving walkways, and related equipment.', '["clm_wiki_otis-worldwide_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
