   'American manufacturing company Not to be confused with Mueller Water Products . Mueller Industries, Inc. Type Public Traded as NYSE : MLI S&amp;P 400 component Industry Piping Founded 1917 &#59;&#32;109 years ago ( 1917 ) Headquarters Collierville, Tennessee , United States Key people Gregory L. Christopher (CEO since 2009) Products Pipes , industrial metals Number of employees c. 4,509 (December 2023) Website muellerindustries Mueller Industries is an American manufacturing company that specializes in piping , industrial metals and climate machinery. It was founded in 1917 and is included on the Fortune 1000 list in 2022. The head office of the company is located in Memphis, Tennessee . [1] Mueller Industries, Inc. is a multi-billion dollar revenue company that is publicly traded . The company has operations throughout the United States, Canada, Mexico, China, South Korea, the Middle East and Great Britain. [2] The current CEO of the company is Gregory L. Christopher, appointed in 2009. [3] ^ Top 1000 Fortune 2022 ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Company Overview" . Mueller Industries . Retrieved 28 April 2014 . ^ "Mueller Industries Inc (MLI:New York Consolidated)" . Business Week. Archived from the original on April 28, 2014 . Retrieved 28 April 2014 . : CS1 maint: deprecated archival service ( link )', '["clm_wiki_mueller_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
