VALUES
  ('cs_mueller_leadership', 'org_mueller', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Products Mueller Industries, Inc. manufactures and sells copper, brass, aluminum, and plastic products in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Great Britain, South Korea and China. It operates in three segments, Plumbing, Industrial Metals &amp; Climate Equipment. The Plumbing &amp; Refrigeration segment offers copper tubes in straight lengths and coils; copper and plastic fittings, line sets, plastic pipes, valves, and related components for use in water distribution systems, heating systems, air-conditioning, and refrigeration applications, as well as for drainage , waste, and vent systems. It also fabricates steel pipe nipples and resells imported brass and plastic plumbing valves, malleable iron fittings, faucets, and plumbing specialty products to plumbing wholesalers and building materials retailers, as well as to distributors of manufactured housing and recreational vehicle industries. [1] This segment markets its products through its sales offices and distribution centers, and a network of agents. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Mueller Industries Inc. Business Summary" . Yahoo Finance . Retrieved 28 April 2014 . ^ "Mueller Industries Inc. Business Summary" . Yahoo Finance . Retrieved 28 April 2014 .', '["clm_wiki_mueller_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
