  ('cs_icf_operations', 'org_icf', 'overview', 'Operations',
   '2019: ICF NEXT In 2019, ICF launched subsidiary ICF NEXT, led by John Armstrong, who had previously co-founded IBM''s Interactive Experience (iX) internal agency. [1] In 2023, ICF Next ceased operations in the United Kingdom, dissolving the UK company in 2024. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "ICF Launches New Agency Network Led by Former IBM iX Executive" . AdWeek . December 4, 2018 . Retrieved June 3, 2020 . ^ "ICF NEXT LIMITED overview - Find and update company information - GOV.UK" . find-and-update .uk . Retrieved June 20, 2025 .', '["clm_wiki_icf_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
