   'Brands and subsidiaries A. O. Smith operates under the following brand names around the world: A. O. Smith (United States, Canada, China, Europe, Turkey, India and Vietnam), Aquasana , [1] GSW (Canada), John Wood (Canada), State Water Heaters , American Water Heaters, Reliance Water Heaters, Lochinvar Corporation , Takagi, Giant Factories Inc. and U.S. Craftmaster Water Heaters. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Grisales, Claudia (September 15, 2016). "Austin''s Aquasana Bought in $87 Million Deal" . Austin American-Statesman . Hearst . Retrieved January 29, 2026 . ^ "A. O. Smith Acquires Canada Water Heater Manufacturer Giant Factories, Inc" (Press release). Milwaukee: A. O. Smith. PR Newswire. October 19, 2021 . Retrieved April 5, 2026 .', '["clm_wiki_a-o-smith_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
