   'A. O. Smith Foundation The A. O. Smith Foundation is a private, nonprofit organization, founded in 1955, that has contributed nearly $50 million to qualifying charitable, educational, scientific, literary, and civic organizations located primarily in communities where A. O. Smith Corporation has facilities. The support for the Foundation comes from the profits of A. O. Smith Corporation. [1] ^ body:not( ):not( ) 2020 Community Impact Report (PDF) (Report). Milwaukee, Wisconsin: A. O. Smith Foundation . Retrieved April 30, 2021 .', '["clm_wiki_a-o-smith_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
