VALUES
  ('cs_arthur-j-gallagher_operations', 'org_arthur-j-gallagher', 'overview', 'Operations',
   '1980s-present During the 1980s and 1990s, the company faced significant competitive pressures within the crowded domestic insurance market in the United States. [1] From 1990 through 2000, the company reported double-digit growth in all but three years, indicating a period of substantial expansion. [1] In 2000, Gallagher acquired 16 smaller insurance brokerages, which expanded its presence across the United States, eventually leading to operations in all 50 states . [1] The company began international expansion in 2002 with entry into India and Asia . [1] In February 2010, Gallagher acquired Securitas Re, a reinsurance brokerage firm based in São Paulo , Brazil , from Estater Gestão de Investimentos Ltda. [2] In March 2010, Gallagher announced an agreement to acquire substantially all of the insurance brokerage operations of FirstCity Partnership, a London -based firm. [3] [4] In 2011, Gallagher established operations in Singapore . [1] In December 2013, Gallagher acquired Bergvall Marine, an insurance brokerage firm based in Oslo , Norway . [1] The company expanded to Australia in 2014. [1] In December 2014, Gallagher announced the expansion of its brand presence in Australia through the rebranding of OAMPS Insurance Brokers, following its acquisition of the firm in June of the same year. [5] In November 2015, Gallagher announced the acquisition of insurance brokers Christie Phoenix (Victoria) and its affiliate Discovery Insurance Services, both based in Victoria, British Columbia . [6] In December 2015, Gallagher, through its New Zealand subsidiary Crombie Lockwood, acquired Reid Manson, an insurance brokerage based in the central region of the South Island . [7] In June 2016, Gallagher announced that several Canadian brokerages operating under the Noraxis group would rebrand to Gallagher. [8] In July 2016, Gallagher acquired an 85% stake in Brim AB, a Stockholm -based specialty insurance and reinsurance brokerage firm. [9] [1] In August 2017, Gallagher acquired B', '["clm_wiki_arthur-j-gallagher_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
