VALUES
  ('cs_booking_leadership', 'org_booking', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'History In 1996, Jay S. Walker founded Priceline Incorporated in Stamford, Connecticut , which launched Priceline , an online travel site, that used a Name Your Own Price bidding model. [1] On March 31, 1999, Priceline Incorporated became a public company via an initial public offering , making Walker, who owned a 35% stake in the company, a multi-billionaire. The company''s original ticker symbol was "PCLN". [2] [1] The company experimented with selling other products and services such as groceries, gasoline, home mortgages, and cars, but these offerings were discontinued in 2000. [3] [4] In July 2005, the company acquired Booking for $133 million and was merged with ActiveHotels , a European online hotel reservation company, purchased by Priceline Group for $161 million in September 2004. [5] In April 2014, the name of the company was changed from priceline Incorporated to The Priceline Group Inc. [6] In August 2017, Kayak acquired the assets of Mundi, a Brazilian metasearch company. [7] [8] In February 2018, the company changed its name to Booking Holdings and changed its Nasdaq ticker symbol to the current "BKNG". [9] [10] In 2021, the company offered to acquire GoToGate ; however, the deal was blocked by European regulators in 2023. [11] Management history Jeffery H. Boyd was named chief executive officer in 2002 and remained in that role until becoming chairman in 2013. [12] Effective January 2014, Darren Huston was named chief executive officer of the company, replacing Jeff Boyd. [13] In April 2016, Huston was forced to resign following an undisclosed personal relationship with an employee, and Boyd was named interim CEO. [14] Effective January 2017, Glenn D. Fogel was named chief executive officer and president. [15] ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) Weber, Thomas E.; Petersen, Andrea (April 1, 1999). "Priceline''s Initial Public Offering Turns Founder Into Billionaire" . The Wall Street Journal . ^ Piskora, Beth (March 31, 1999). "Priceline Blasts Off – Online Ticket', '["clm_wiki_booking_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
