VALUES
  ('cs_bunge-global_operations', 'org_bunge-global', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Recent In May 2017, Glencore in Switzerland began pursuing the acquisition of Bunge. [1] In early June 2017, Bunge hired advisers to help it fend off Glencore''s takeover interest. [2] In January 2017, Archer Daniels Midland agreed to sell its crop risk services (insurance) unit to Validus Holdings for $127.5 million. [3] On January 19, 2018, it was reported that Archer Daniels Midland had approached Bunge Ltd. about a takeover, with details "unclear." At that point, Bunge had a market value of about $9.8 billion, and was still being pursued by Glencore. [1] In 2019, Bunge relocated its global headquarters from White Plains, New York , to the St Louis metropolitan area in 2020, where the company had its US headquarters. [4] In April 2020, Bunge announced it agreed to sell 35 U.S interior grain elevators to Zen-Noh Corporation . [5] The completion of the sale was subject to regulatory approval and closed in December 2021. [6] In 2021, Bunge was ranked 18th on FoodTalks'' Global Top 40 Plant Protein Producers list. [7] A 2023, Bloomberg Businessweek described Bunge''s food science pivot. [8] Sunflower oil produced by Bunge Ukraine. In 2023, a merger with Viterra was announced. [9] In July 2025, the merger with Viterra was completed. [10] On 5 January 2026 a Bunge sunflower oil production plant in Dnipro , Ukraine , was hit in a Russian drone attack . [11] [12] Resulting in 300 tonnes of oil spilled onto roads. [11] [13] Ukrainian Foreign Minister Andrii Sybiha claimed on 6 January 2026 that the attack was not accidental and he assessed that Russia was systematically attacking American businesses in Ukraine. [12] ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) Bunge, Jacob; Mattioli, Dana (January 19, 2018). "ADM Has Made Takeover Approach to Bunge Ltd" . The Wall Street Journal . The New York Times, New York City, United States . Retrieved January 21, 2018 . ^ Hume, Neil; Fontanella-Khan, James (June 4, 2017). "Bunge hires JPMorgan and Shearman &amp; Sterling in Glencore defence" . Financial T', '["clm_wiki_bunge-global_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
