VALUES
  ('cs_centerpoint-energy_history', 'org_centerpoint-energy', 'overview', 'History',
   'US electric and natural gas utility company html body This article''s factual accuracy may be compromised due to out-of-date information . Please help update this article to reflect recent events or newly available information. ( May 2026 ) This article may need to be rewritten to comply with Wikipedia''s quality standards . Relevant discussion may be found on the talk page . You can help . The talk page may contain suggestions. ( May 2026 ) CenterPoint Energy, Inc. Centerpoint Energy Plaza , CenterPoint Energy headquarters in Downtown Houston . Type Public Traded as NYSE : CNP S&amp;P 500 component Industry Utilities Founded 1882 &#59;&#32;144 years ago ( 1882 ) Headquarters CenterPoint Energy Tower Houston, Texas , US Key people Jason P. Wells ( CEO &amp; president ) (2023) [1] Revenue US$ 7.418 billion (Fiscal Year Ended December 31, 2020) [2] Operating income US$1.039 billion (Fiscal Year Ended December 31, 2020) [2] Net income US$–773 million (Fiscal Year Ended December 31, 2020) [2] Total assets US$33.471 billion (Fiscal Year Ended December 31, 2020) [2] Total equity US$8.348 billion (Fiscal Year Ended December 31, 2020) [2] Number of employees 8,827 (December 2023) Website www CenterPoint Energy, Inc. is an American utility company based in Houston, Texas, that provides electric and natural gas utility to customers in several markets in the American states of Indiana , Ohio , Louisiana , Minnesota , Mississippi , and Texas . Part of the Fortune 500 , the company was formerly known as Reliant Energy , NorAm Energy, Houston Industries, and HL&amp;P. The company is headquartered in the CenterPoint Energy Tower at 1111 Louisiana Street in Downtown Houston . [3] [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Kosur, James. "PG&amp;E taps Jason Wells to be its next CFO" . Business Insider . ^ a b c d e "CenterPoint Energy 2020 Annual Report Results" . ^ " Contact Information ." CenterPoint Energy. Retrieved January 14, 2009. ^ " CenterPoint Energy Tower Archived 2012-07-05 at the Way