company headquartered in Armonk, New York , and present in over 175 countries. [7] [8] It is a publicly traded company and one of the 30 companies in the Dow Jones Industrial Average . &#91; a &#93; [9] [10] IBM is the largest industrial research organization in the world, with 19 research facilities across a dozen countries; for 29 consecutive years, from 1993 to 2021, it held the record for most annual U.S. patents generated by a business. IBM was founded in 1911 as the Computing-Tabulating-Record', '["clm_wiki_ibm_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
