  ('cs_regeneron-pharmaceuticals_leadership', 'org_regeneron-pharmaceuticals', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Financial performance Financial year Revenue [1] 2012 $1.4 billion 2013 $2.1 billion 2014 $2.8 billion 2015 $4.1 billion 2016 $4.8 billion 2017 $5.8 billion 2018 $6.7 billion 2019 $7.8 billion 2020 $8.5 billion 2021 $16.1 billion 2022 $12.2 billion 2023 $13.1 billion 2024 $14.2 billion ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Regeneron Pharmaceuticals Revenue 2006–2021 | REGN" . Stock Research . MacroTrends. Table (Regeneron Pharmaceuticals Annual Revenue) . Retrieved July 26, 2021 .', '["clm_wiki_regeneron-pharmaceuticals_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
