  ('cs_first-merchants_history', 'org_first-merchants', 'overview', 'History',
   'Financial holding company in Indiana, United States First Merchants Corporation Corporate office in Muncie, Indiana Trade name First Merchants Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : FRME Russell 2000 Component Founded 1892 &#59;&#32;134 years ago ( 1892 ) Headquarters Muncie, Indiana , United States Key people Mark Hardwick ( CEO ) Products Banking , Trust Total assets $21.2 billion USD (2026) Number of employees 2,224 (2023) Website firstmerchants First Merchants Corporation is a financial holding company in Central Indiana, [1] headquartered in Muncie, Indiana . The Corporation includes First Merchants Bank and First Merchants Private Wealth Advisors (a division of First Merchants Bank). The company is listed on the NASDAQ as FRME. As of March 2026, total asset size of First Merchants Corporation was $21.1 billion. [2] First Merchants offers commercial banking, personal banking, and investment advisor services. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Investors | First Merchants" . www . Retrieved 2016-05-05 . ^ "Investor Relations | First Merchants Corporation" . ir . Retrieved 2022-04-01 .', '["clm_wiki_first-merchants_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
