VALUES
  ('cs_first-merchants_leadership', 'org_first-merchants', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Recognition In June 2022, First Merchants Bank was ranked by Forbes as one of America''s Best Banks. [1] This is the 5th year in a row First Merchants has received this award. In March 2021, Forbes ranked First Merchants Bank as a top U.S. bank for the 4th consecutive year. [2] First Merchants Bank was ranked #2 on the “America''s Best Bank list in January 2019. [3] [4] compiled by Forbes, up from their #4 ranking in 2018. [5] In May, 2022, First Merchants Bank was voted 4th in "Great Employers to Work for in Indiana" by the Best Companies Group. [6] Additionally, First Merchants Bank was listed as one of the “Best Places to Work in Indiana” by the Indiana Chamber of Commerce in 2018 for Major Companies with 1,000+ employees [7] and again in 2019. [8] First Merchants Bank was named as one of the “Best Places to Work” by Columbus Business First for 2018 [9] and as one of the 2019 Best Employers in Ohio, a list created by the Ohio SHRM State Council, Crain''s Cleveland Business and Best Companies Group. First Merchants was also named one of the “Best Places to Work” in the state of Illinois in 2018 [10] and again in 2019. Comparably gives First Merchants Bank an A+ on Culture Score [11] with a 4.7 out of 5 star rating based on 133+ employee survey responses as of June 2022. First Merchants Bank was rated as one of the best "In-State Banks" by Forbes and Statistica in June 2022. [12] First Merchants was also rated as one of the top big banks in the US by Newsweek magazine in 2022 [13] and one of the top 20 banks in the US by S&amp;P Global Market Intelligence in 2022. [14] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "America''s Best Banks 2022" . Forbes . Retrieved 2022-06-29 . ^ "Forbes ranks First Merchants as top U.S. Bank for fourth consecutive year" . Default . ^ "Forbes ranks First Merchants Bank #2 of America''s Best Banks" . www . Retrieved 2019-03-04 . ^ Badenhausen, Kurt. "America''s Best And Worst Banks 2019" . Forbes . Retrieved 2019-03-04 . ^ "Forbes ranks First Merchants as top-five ', '["clm_wiki_first-merchants_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
