  ('cs_svb-financial_overview', 'org_svb-financial', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'SVB Financial Group is a financial services holding company headquartered in New York City. The company''s main business unit was the commercial bank Silicon Valley Bank, until the bank failed in March 2023 after a bank run. The company was a member of the S&P 500 index until March 15, 2023. According to public filings, as of December 31, 2022, SVB Financial Group had 164 subsidiaries.', '["clm_wiki_svb-financial_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
