   'Howmet Aerospace Inc. is an American aerospace company based in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. The company manufactures components for jet engines, fasteners, titanium structures for aerospace applications, and forged aluminum wheels for heavy trucks.', '["clm_wiki_howmet-aerospace_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
