   'Investments As of June 30, 2024, the company owned 15,450 properties totaling approximately 335.3 million leasable square feet. [1] [2] The company''s largest tenants are as follows: [1] [2] Rank Tenant % of Total Portfolio Annualized Contractual Rent 1 Dollar General 3.4% 2 Walgreens 3.3% 3 Dollar Tree / Family Dollar 3.1% 4 7-Eleven 2.6% 5 EG Group 2.2% 6 Wynn Resorts 2.1% 7 Life Time Fitness 2.0% 8 FedEx 2.0% 9 BJ''s Wholesale Club 1.6% 10 (B&amp;Q) Kingfisher 1.6% ^ a b Cite error: The named reference 10K was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) "Inline XBRL Viewer" . www . Retrieved 2024-10-04 .', '["clm_wiki_realty-income_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
