   'SBA Communications Corporation is a real estate investment trust which owns and operates wireless infrastructure in the United States, Canada, Central America, South America, and South Africa. It was founded in 1989 as Steven Bernstein and Associates by Steven Bernstein.', '["clm_wiki_sba-communications_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
