   'Verizon Communications Inc. is an American telecommunications company headquartered in New York City. It is the world''s second-largest telecommunications company by revenue and its mobile network is the largest wireless carrier in the United States, with 146.8 million subscribers as of March 31, 2026.', '["clm_wiki_verizon_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
