VALUES
  ('cs_mizuho-americas_leadership', 'org_mizuho-americas', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Divisions Mizuho Securities USA LLC (”MSUSA”) operates as an institutional brokerage firm, focusing focuses on equity, futures clearing, execution, and fixed income products, as well as specializes in raising capital through mergers and acquisition, debt, equity underwriting, and advisory services. [1] It is an SEC-registered Broker-Dealer [2] and a Primary Dealer of US Treasuries designated by the Federal Reserve Bank of New York. [3] MSUSA is also registered with the CFTC as a futures commission merchant (FCM). [4] MSUSA’s Equity Division provides equity research, capital markets access, and extensive equity and equity-linked distribution and execution capabilities for the equity markets in Asia and the Americas. MSUSA also has a Corporate Access [5] desk that arranges numerous non-deal road shows. [6] In 2010 MSUSA participated as Global Joint Coordinator on Dai-Ichi Life IPO, which was the largest IPO in Japan and 2nd largest globally for the year, [7] [8] and in the $6 billion Mizuho Financial Group global offering. In September 2023, Mizuho Americas won a lead role as underwriter for British multinational semiconductor and software design company Arm Holdings initial public offering (IPO). [9] The IPO was the biggest of 2023, and the largest offering in the technology field since Alibaba Group in 2014. [10] MSUSA’s Fixed Income Division client relationship list includes central banks , banks, municipalities , hedge funds , asset managers and insurance corporations. MSUSA’s fixed income products include: US Treasuries, corporate bonds , Debt Capital Markets, US Agency Securities, Securities Financing, Strategic Credit Group, mortgage- and asset-backed securities, Japanese Government Bonds, Yen Fixed Income, Emerging Markets [11] MSUSA’s Futures Division provides futures clearing and execution services across a spectrum of institutional clients. [12] MSUSA provides market coverage through Electronic Execution Services, Clearing Services and Voice Execution Servi', '["clm_wiki_mizuho-americas_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
