  ('cs_axos_leadership', 'org_axos', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Acquisitions # Date Assets Ref(s). 1 September 2013 $173 million in deposits from Principal Bank [1] 2 September 2015 Bank unit of H&amp;R Block [2] [3] 3 March 2016 $140 million of equipment leases from Pacific Western Equipment Finance [4] 4 November 2018 $3 billion in deposits and 40,000 customers from Nationwide Bank [5] [6] 5 January 2019 COR Clearing LLC (rebranded as Axos Clearing) [7] 6 March 2019 WiseBanyan (rebranded as Axos Invest) [8] [9] 7 March 2019 $175 million in deposits from MWABank [10] 8 August 2021 E*TRADE Advisor Services (rebranded as Axos Advisor Services) [11] 9 August 2023 Marine finance business of Bank of Clarke [12] 10 December 2023 Two loans from the FDIC previously owned by Signature Bank (unpaid principal balance of $1.253 billion; cost of 63% of par value) [13] [14] 11 September 2025 Verdant Commercial Capital, an equipment leasing firm; price was $43.5 million [15] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "BofI Federal Bank Completes $173 Million Deposit Acquisition From Principal Bank" (Press release). Marketwired . September 9, 2013 &#8211; via Yahoo Finance . ^ "BofI Federal Bank Completes Deposit Transaction With H&amp;R Block" (Press release). Marketwired . September 1, 2015 &#8211; via Yahoo Finance . ^ "Bank of Internet USA Launches Individual Retirement Accounts (IRAs) Through H&amp;R Block Partnership" (Press release). Marketwired . January 13, 2016 &#8211; via Yahoo Finance . ^ "BofI Holding, Inc. Announces Acquisition of Equipment Leases and Operations of Pacific Western Equipment Finance" (Press release). Marketwired . April 4, 2016. ^ "Axos Bank Closes Nationwide Bank Deposit Acquisition" (Press release). Business Wire . November 19, 2018. ^ Ross, Hailey (October 24, 2018). "Axos Bank enters strategic relationship with Nationwide" . S&amp;P Global . ^ "Axos Financial, Inc. Closes COR Clearing LLC Acquisition" (Press release). Business Wire . January 29, 2019. ^ "Axos Financial, Inc. Completes WiseBanyan Acquisition" (Press release). Bu