  ('cs_rockland-trust_overview', 'org_rockland-trust', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Rockland Trust is a commercial bank based in Rockland, Massachusetts that serves Southeastern Massachusetts, Coastal Massachusetts, Cape Cod, and Boston''s MetroWest. Established in 1907 as Rockland Trust Company. A wholly owned subsidiary of Independent Bank Corp., by October 2016, Rockland Trust had $7.5 billion in assets and employed around 1,000 people. By April 2022, Rockland Trust had $20 billion in assets and employed around 1,100 people.', '["clm_wiki_rockland-trust_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
