  ('cs_rockland-trust_history', 'org_rockland-trust', 'overview', 'History',
   'Commercial bank in Massachusetts, U.S. Rockland Trust Type Subsidiary Industry Banking Founded September 1907 &#59;&#32;118 years ago ( 1907-09 ) Headquarters Rockland, Massachusetts , U.S. Key people Jeffrey Tengel ( CEO ) Total assets US$ 20 billion (2021) [1] [2] Number of employees 1,100+ (2021) [1] Parent Independent Bank Corp. ( Nasdaq : INDB ) Website www Rockland Trust is a commercial bank based in Rockland, Massachusetts that serves Southeastern Massachusetts , Coastal Massachusetts, Cape Cod , and Boston''s MetroWest . Established in 1907 [3] as Rockland Trust Company. A wholly owned subsidiary of Independent Bank Corp., [4] by October 2016, Rockland Trust had $7.5 billion in assets and employed around 1,000 people. [5] By April 2022, Rockland Trust had $20 billion in assets and employed around 1,100 people. [1] [2] ^ a b c Cite error: The named reference MER;MERG was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ a b Cite error: The named reference USBANK;RTC was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ http://www4 /IDASP/main_bankfind (search Rockland Trust Company) ^ Cite error: The named reference B;B was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ Cite error: The named reference VIN;GAZ was invoked but never defined (see the help page ).', '["clm_wiki_rockland-trust_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
