  ('cs_j-b-hunt_leadership', 'org_j-b-hunt', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Corporate responsibility Sustainability J.B. Hunt has reserved several Tesla electric trucks and added all-electric box trucks to its fleet. [1] In early 2025, J.B. Hunt was admitted into the Dow Jones Sustainability North America index (for 2024), making it the only road transportation company in the index at the time. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Cheng, Evelyn. "Tesla shares pop after trucker JB Hunt reserves ''multiple'' semitractor-trailers" . CNBC. ^ Staff, Talk Business &amp; Politics. (2025, February 4). J.B. Hunt joins Dow Jones Sustainability Index . Talk Business &amp; Politics. Retrieved October 8, 2025, from ÷ https://talkbusiness /2025/02/j-b-hunt-joins-dow-jones-sustainability-index/', '["clm_wiki_j-b-hunt_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
