   'Juniper Networks, Inc., was an American multinational corporation headquartered in Sunnyvale, California. The company developed and marketed networking products, including routers, switches, network management software, network security products, and software-defined networking technology.', '["clm_wiki_juniper-networks_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
