   'Orchard Supply Hardware (OSH) was an American retailer of home improvement and gardening products. Headquartered in San Jose, California, Orchard Supply Hardware had dozens of locations throughout California, with expansions into Oregon and Florida.', '["clm_wiki_orchard-supply-hardware_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
