   version, created_at, updated_at, display_order, claim_count, source_count, last_verified_at)
VALUES
  ('cs_nextdoor_history', 'org_nextdoor', 'overview', 'History',
   'Hyperlocal social networking service for neighborhoods For other uses, see Next Door (disambiguation) . Nextdoor Holdings, Inc. Headquarters in San Francisco in 2022 Type Public Traded as NYSE : NXDR Founded 2008 &#59;&#32;18 years ago ( 2008 ) Founders Nirav Tolia Prakash Janakiraman David Wiesen Sarah Leary Headquarters San Francisco , California, US Area served Australia, Canada, Denmark, France, Germany, Italy, Netherlands, Spain, Sweden, UK, US Key people Nirav Tolia (CEO) Revenue US$ 218 million (2023) Operating income − US$ 172 million (2023) Net income − US$ 148 million (2023) Total assets US$ 655 million (2023) Total equity US$ 559 million (2023) Number of employees 594 (2023) Website nextdoor Footnotes [1] [2] Nextdoor Holdings, Inc. is an American company that operates a hyperlocal social networking service for neighborhoods. The company was founded in 2008 and is based in San Francisco , California. Nextdoor launched in the United States in October 2011. [3] It is available in eleven countries as of May 2023. [4] In 2024, the company claimed to have 88 million "neighbors" as members. [5] Users of Nextdoor are required to submit their legal names and addresses to the website. [6] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "US SEC: 2022 Form 10-K Nextdoor Holdings, Inc" . U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission . February 27, 2024. ^ " "Help Center"; Nextdoor" . Archived from the original on March 24, 2020 . Retrieved March 24, 2020 . ^ Lee, Ellen (March 2, 2012). "Nextdoor offers online forum for neighborhoods" . San Francisco Chronicle . Archived from the original on March 5, 2016 . Retrieved December 31, 2015 . ^ "About Nextdoor, the Neighborhood Network | Nextdoor" . About Nextdoor . Retrieved May 7, 2023 . ^ "About Nextdoor, the Neighborhood Network | Nextdoor" . About Nextdoor . Retrieved May 26, 2024 . ^ Cite error: The named reference Stross was invoked but never defined (see the help page ).', '["clm_wiki_nextdoor_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
