   'Gartner, Inc. is an American research and advisory firm focusing on business and technology topics. Gartner provides its products and services through research reports, conferences, and consulting. Its clients include large corporations, government agencies, technology companies, and investment firms.', '["clm_wiki_gartner_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
