  ('cs_loews_overview', 'org_loews', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Loews Corporation is an American conglomerate headquartered in New York City. The company''s majority-stake holdings include CNA Financial Corporation, Boardwalk Pipelines, Loews Hotels and Altium Packaging.', '["clm_wiki_loews_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
