VALUES
  ('cs_public-storage_operations', 'org_public-storage', 'overview', 'Operations',
   '2000-present In 2006, the company acquired Shurgard Storage Centers in a $5.5 billion transaction, acquiring 624 locations, including 141 in Europe. [1] Public Storage had attempted to acquire the company in 2000 and again in 2005, but its offers were rejected. [2] [3] In 2007, a customer''s belongings were auctioned for non-payment while he was serving the US military in Iraq. After receiving negative publicity, Public Storage apologized and gave him $8,000 as compensation for his sold belongings. [4] In March 2010, the company acquired 30 locations from A-American Self Storage for $189 million. [5] In December 2013, the company acquired a 44-property portfolio from Stor-All Storage for $430 million. [6] In December 2020, the company acquired 36 properties containing 3.6 million net rentable square feet from Beyond Self Storage for $528 million. [7] In April 2021, the company acquired the 48-property ezStorage portfolio, with properties in the Washington metropolitan area , for $1.8 billion. [8] [9] [10] [11] In December 2021, the company acquired All Storage, owner of 56 self-storage properties containing 7.5 million net rentable square feet primarily in the Dallas-Fort Worth market, for $1.5 billion. [12] [13] [14] [15] In February 2023, the company bid to acquire Life Storage but was outbid by Extra Space Storage . [16] In September 2023, the company acquired Simply Self Storage, with 127 properties comprising 9 million rentable square feet, from affiliates of The Blackstone Group , for $2.2 billion. [17] [18] [19] [20] [21] In February 2026, the company announced a corporate relocation to Frisco, Texas . [22] In July 2026, the company announced the anticipated closing date for the acquisition of National Storage Affiliates (NSA) [23] after approval by shareholders of NSA. [24] ^ body:not( ):not( ) White, Ronald (January 18, 2015). "Public Storage is poised for further growth" . Los Angeles Times . ^ Cite error: The named reference vault was invoked but never def', '["clm_wiki_public-storage_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
