  ('cs_solventum_history', 'org_solventum', 'overview', 'History',
   'American health care company Solventum Corporation Type Public Traded as NYSE : SOLV S&amp;P 500 component Industry Health care Predecessor 3M (health care division) Founded January 24, 2023 &#59;&#32;3 years ago ( 2023-01-24 ) (incorporation) April 1, 2024 &#59;&#32;2 years ago ( 2024-04-01 ) (spinoff) Headquarters Eagan, Minnesota , U.S. Key people Bryan Hanson (CEO) Revenue US$ 8.25 billion (2024) Operating income US$1.04 billion (2024) Net income US$479 million (2024) Total assets US$14.5 billion (2024) Total equity US$2.96 billion (2024) Number of employees 22,000 (2024) Website solventum Footnotes [1] Solventum Corporation is an American health care company that was spun off from 3M on April 1, 2024. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "2024 Annual Report (Form 10-K)" . U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission. February 28, 2025.', '["clm_wiki_solventum_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
