  ('cs_yelp_overview', 'org_yelp', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Yelp Inc. is an American company that develops the Yelp.com website and the Yelp mobile app, which publishes crowd-sourced reviews about businesses. It also operates Yelp Guest Manager, a table reservation service. It is headquartered in San Francisco.', '["clm_wiki_yelp_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
