   'Politics The former CEO of Alliant Energy, Patricia Kampling, wrote a guest editorial in The Gazette where she wrote that Alliant Energy and the American Wind Association presented Republican U.S. Senator Chuck Grassley of Iowa with AWEA''s Wind Champion Award. Grassley is often referred to as the "father" of American wind energy because of his work on the federal renewable energy production tax credit, according to Kampling. [1] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Kampling, Patricia (2018-09-05). "Grassley is an Iowa ''wind champion'' " . The Gazette . Archived from the original on 2018-09-28 . Retrieved 2018-09-27 .', '["clm_wiki_alliant-energy_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
