VALUES
  ('cs_equinix_leadership', 'org_equinix', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Acquisitions and expansion In 2002, Equinix merged with I-STT, the Internet infrastructure service subsidiary of Singapore Technologies Telemedia , and Pihana Pacific. [1] This established the company''s presence in China , Singapore , Australia , and Japan . [2] In 2007, the firm entered the European market by acquiring data center operator IXEurope and its facilities. In 2010, Equinix opened its 50th data center in London. [3] Over the next seven years, the company nearly tripled its data center portfolio. The company attributed this growth to increased demand, which was caused by the emergence of cloud computing, the Internet of Things , and big data . [4] [5] [6] In 2010, the company purchased Switch and Data Facilities Company, Inc., a U.S. Internet exchange and colocation services provider. [7] In 2012, the company extended its operations to the Middle East, expanding to Dubai , and in Southeast Asia , specifically Indonesia . [8] [9] Also in 2012, it acquired Hong Kong -based data center provider Asia-Tone. [10] In 2014, Equinix increased its Latin American presence when it acquired ALOG Datacenters of Brazil S.A., the country''s leading provider of carrier-neutral data centers. [11] In 2015, Equinix converted to a real estate investment trust (REIT) to gain tax advantages and add shareholder value. [12] That same year, it acquired the professional services company Nimbo. [13] In May 2015, Equinix said it would purchase the British company TelecityGroup , the largest acquisition in the company''s history. [14] The offer was cleared by the European Commission (EC) in November, [15] after Equinix agreed to sell eight of its data centers around Europe to Digital Realty , [16] [17] while retaining its Telecity Harbour Exchange data center in London Docklands , [18] an acquisition Equinix completed in a transaction valued at approximately $3.8 billion. [19] The addition of these data centers more than doubled Equinix''s capacity in Europe. [20] In December 2015, the c', '["clm_wiki_equinix_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
  (id, entity_id, section_type, heading, body_markdown, claim_ids, source_ids,
   reading_level, language, author_type, generator_version, editorial_status,
