  ('cs_nordson_leadership', 'org_nordson', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Corporate structure and company culture Nordson Corporation is headquartered in Westlake, Ohio, U.S., with its Global Headquarters located at 28601 Clemens Road, Westlake, Ohio 44145-4551. [1] The company operates globally and comprises nine distinct divisions, each serving unique industry sectors: [2] Nordson Adhesive Dispensing Systems Nordson EFD (Engineered Fluid Dispensing) Nordson Electronics Solutions Nordson Industrial Coating Solutions Nordson Measurement &amp; Control Nordson Medical Nordson Polymer Processing Systems Nordson Precision Agriculture Nordson Test &amp; Inspection There are facilities and sales-support offices in approximately 30 countries. [3] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Contact Us – Global Headquarters" . Retrieved 25 August 2025 . ^ "Our Divisions" . Retrieved 25 August 2025 . ^ "History of Nordson Corporation" . Retrieved 25 August 2025 .', '["clm_wiki_nordson_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
