  ('cs_skyworks-solutions_leadership', 'org_skyworks-solutions', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Products Skyworks products, such as low-noise and power amplifiers , connectivity switches or radio co-processors, can be used in the automotive, streaming or broadcast industry. [1] [2] Other products include DRM platforms for cars, [3] RF switches [4] as well as power management chips. [5] A GSM power amplifier and a RF switch from Skyworks were used in the iPhone 15 . [6] Skyworks achieved IATF 16949 Automotive Certification in 2024 [7] . ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Skyworks Ramps Ups Products for Streaming Media &amp; Smart TV for OEMs - Roku, Google &amp; Samsung" . thefastmode . 2015-01-03 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "Skyworks'' digital radio co-processors help optimize in-vehicle infotainment" . embedded . 2023-10-05 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "Skyworks Announces New DRM Product for Automotive Industry" . drm . 9 December 2021 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "Global RF and Microwave Switches Market Research Report 2024: Delving into Market Status, Size, and Industry Needs up to 2030" . industrytoday.co.uk. 2024-02-20 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "Skyworks to Showcase its Power Management and Control Solutions at APEC 2022" . everythingpe . 2022-03-21 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "TechInsights Teardown: Apple iPhone 15" . globalspec . 2024-02-16 . Retrieved 2024-03-13 . ^ "Skyworks Achieves IATF 16949 Automotive Certification for its Analog &amp; Mixed Signal Solutions" . everythingrf . 2024-11-14 . Retrieved 2024-11-14 .', '["clm_wiki_skyworks-solutions_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
