  ('cs_rocket-companies_leadership', 'org_rocket-companies', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Subsidiaries Rocket Mortgage : Rocket Mortgage is the largest mortgage lender in the United States. [1] It offers a fully online mortgage process. [2] Rocket Money : Rocket Money is a budgeting app that links to users'' bank accounts to help track income and spending. The app includes features such as subscription cancellation and bill negotiation. [3] Rocket Homes : Rocket Homes is a real estate search platform which offers maps of nearby listings, referrals to real estate agents, and virtual reality tours of properties. [4] [5] Rocket Close : Rocket Close, formerly known as Amrock, is a title producer, settlement provider and appraisal management company. [6] [7] Rocket Loans : Rocket Loans is an online personal loan company which features an online application with same-day funding. [8] Rocket Title Insurance Company : Formerly known as Amrock Title Insurance Company, Rocket Title Insurance Company is a nationwide title insurer. [9] Forsalebyowner : ForSaleByOwner is a real estate classified advertising site which enables homeowners to buy and sell properties on their own under the for sale by owner home purchasing model. [10] Founded in 1999, Rocket acquired the site in 2018 from Tribune Publishing (which bought the site in 2006). [11] [12] [13] Core Digital Media : Core Digital Media is an advertiser in the mortgage and insurance world. [8] Lowermybills : Lowermybills provides comparisons for mortgages, reverse mortgages, refinancing, loans and insurance. [14] Lendesk :Based in Vancouver, LenDesk is a technology company that offers a suite of products to digitize the home loan experience for Canadian mortgage brokers and their clients. [15] Mr. Cooper Group :American home loan servicer headquartered in the Dallas, Texas area. [16] Rocket Innovation Studio : Rocket Innovation Studio, based in Windsor, Ontario, recruits Canadian talent to develop technology solutions for Rocket Companies. [17] Woodward Capital Management : Woodward Capital Management is a firm whi', '["clm_wiki_rocket-companies_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
