VALUES
  ('cs_vimeo_operations', 'org_vimeo', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Leadership After the departures of Lodwick and Klein, IAC brought in a more corporate structure to the company. By January 2009, Dae Mellencamp joined IAC as general manager of Vimeo. [1] She was CEO until March 19, 2012, when Kerry Trainor joined Vimeo as CEO. [2] Around 2016, several high-level executives announced their departure from Vimeo, including Trainor. IAC''s CEO Joey Levin was named as interim CEO for Vimeo during its search for a new CEO. [3] After a year-long search, IAC promoted then general manager Anjali Sud as the CEO. [4] [5] In August 2023, Anjali Sud stepped down from the role. Adam Gross was appointed the interim CEO. [6] Philip Moyer, a former executive with Google Cloud , was named the new CEO in April 2024. [7] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "ManagementBios" . IAC. Archived from the original on November 22, 2012 . Retrieved January 31, 2012 . ^ "IAC replaces Vimeo CEO with former AOL exec Kerry Trainor" . VentureBeat . March 19, 2012. Archived from the original on October 9, 2019 . Retrieved November 13, 2017 . ^ Spangler, Todd (June 7, 2016). "Kerry Trainor Steps Down as Vimeo CEO" . Variety . Retrieved May 29, 2020 . ^ La Monica, Paul R. (June 26, 2019). "Vimeo is thriving as the anti-YouTube. Here''s the CEO''s plan for the future" . CNN . Archived from the original on August 14, 2020 . Retrieved May 8, 2020 . ^ Spangler, Todd (July 20, 2017). "IAC''s Vimeo Appoints Anjali Sud CEO After Yearlong Search" . Variety . Archived from the original on January 9, 2019 . Retrieved January 8, 2019 . ^ "Vimeo Announces Departure of Anjali Sud as CEO, Appointment of Adam Gross as Interim CEO" . July 5, 2023. Archived from the original on September 14, 2023 . Retrieved September 12, 2023 . ^ Haring, Bruce (April 4, 2024). "Vimeo Taps Philip Moyer As New CEO, Former Google Cloud Executive" . Deadline Hollywood . Archived from the original on April 5, 2024 . Retrieved April 4, 2024 .', '["clm_wiki_vimeo_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
