  ('cs_urban-one_overview', 'org_urban-one', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Urban One, Inc. is an American media conglomerate based in Silver Spring, Maryland. Founded in 1980 by Cathy Hughes, the company primarily operates media properties targeting African Americans.', '["clm_wiki_urban-one_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
