VALUES
  ('cs_tripadvisor_leadership', 'org_tripadvisor', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   '2000–2009 Tripadvisor LLC was founded by Stephen Kaufer, Langley Steinert, Nick Shanny, and Thomas Palka in February 2000. [1] [2] Kaufer came up with the idea of such a company after being frustrated with planning a family vacation. [3] [4] Headquarters in Needham, Massachusetts In September 2000, before the website was launched, the company obtained $2 million in seed money financing from Flagship Ventures , the Bollard Group, and private investors. [5] [6] By 2004, the website had 5 million unique visitors per month. [2] That same year, the company was acquired by IAC/InterActiveCorp . [7] [2] In August 2005, IAC spun off its travel group of businesses under Expedia . [8] [9] [10] In 2007 and 2008, the company acquired several travel-related websites. In 2007, it purchased Smarter Travel Media and its associated sites, including SeatGuru and Cruise Critic . [11] In 2008, it acquired Holiday Watchdog , Airfarewatchdog, VirtualTourist , OneTime , and a majority stake in FlipKey . [12] [13] [14] [15] [16] [17] [18] [19] &#91; excessive citations &#93; In April 2009, Tripadvisor launched in China. [20] The company acquired Kuxun.cn, China''s second-largest consumer travel site and hotel and flight search engine, in October 2009. [21] In August 2015, Kuxun was sold to Meituan . [22] [23] [24] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Sides, Seeing Both. "Scaling is Hard, Case Study: TripAdvisor" . Business Insider . Retrieved 2025-11-05 . ^ a b c Kinstler, Linda (2018-08-17). "How TripAdvisor changed travel" . The Guardian . ISSN 0261-3077 . Retrieved 2025-11-05 . ^ Staff, The Harbus News (2013-04-01). "An Interview with Stephen Kaufer, Co-Founder &amp; CEO of TripAdvisor" . The Harbus . Retrieved 2025-11-18 . ^ Wayshak, Marc (11 April 2014). "TripAdvisor CEO''s 5 Tips To Startup Success" . Fast Company . Retrieved 18 November 2025 . ^ "TripAdvisor snags $2 million in first round financing" . Mediaroom . September 1, 2000. Archived from the original on 2023-01-21 . Retrieved 2023-01-21 . ^ ', '["clm_wiki_tripadvisor_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
  (id, entity_id, section_type, heading, body_markdown, claim_ids, source_ids,
