  ('cs_abercrombie-fitch_overview', 'org_abercrombie-fitch', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Abercrombie & Fitch Co. (A&F) is an American lifestyle retailer founded in 1892, which focuses on contemporary clothing targeting customers in their early 20s to mid 40s. Headquartered in New Albany, Ohio, the company operates four offshoot brands: Abercrombie Kids, Your Personal Best, Hollister Co., and Gilly Hicks with 780+ company operated stores across its brands, as of Q4 2024.', '["clm_wiki_abercrombie-fitch_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
