VALUES
  ('cs_cognizant_leadership', 'org_cognizant', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Corporate affairs Cognizant''s Delivery Center in Chennai Management Cognizant is led by Ravi Kumar S (CEO) as of 12 January 2023 &#91;update&#93; . Jatin Dalal (CFO) [1] a, Surya Gummadi [2] and Rajesh Nambiar (President, Digital Business &amp; Technology) [3] are some of the others in the leadership team. On 1 April 2019, Francisco D''Souza was replaced by Brian Humphries as the CEO. [4] On 12 January 2023, Brian Humphries was replaced by former Infosys President, Ravi Kumar Singisetti as the CEO. [5] Finance Year Fortune 500 rank 2024 213 2023 208 2022 194 [6] 2021 185 [7] 2020 194 [8] 2019 193 [9] 2018 195 [10] 2017 205 [11] 2016 230 [12] 2015 288 [13] 2014 308 [14] 2013 352 [15] 2012 398 [16] 2011 484 [17] Cognizant was listed on NASDAQ in 1998, and added to the NASDAQ-100 Index in 2004. After the close of trading on 16 November 2006, Cognizant moved from the mid cap S&amp;P 400 to the S&amp;P 500 . [18] Cognizant became a Fortune 500 company in 2011. [19] Corporate social responsibility Cognizant''s philanthropic and corporate social responsibility (CSR) initiatives are conducted through the Cognizant employees for the financial and administrative support of the Cognizant Foundation. [20] [21] Registered in March 2005 as a "Charitable Company" under the Indian Companies Act, the Cognizant Foundation aims to help "unprivileged members of society gain access to quality education and healthcare by providing financial and technical support; designing and implementing educational and healthcare improvement programs; and partnering with Non-Government Organizations (NGOs), educational institutions, healthcare institutions, government agencies and corporations". Cognizant has a grassroots corporate social responsibility project called Outreach , through which the volunteer employees lend their expertise for devising skill-building and workforce programs to improve the operations of NGOs. [22] [23] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Jatin Dalal" . www . Retrieved June 13, 2024 . ^ "L', '["clm_wiki_cognizant_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
