  ('cs_generac_leadership', 'org_generac', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Generac goes public On February 11, 2010, Generac Holdings Inc. (NYSE: GNRC), parent company of Generac Power Systems, Inc., began trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the ticker symbol GNRC. [1] The initial public offering provided $224 million in net proceeds, which were used to pay down debt. [1] ^ a b Cite error: The named reference AR2010 was invoked but never defined (see the help page ).', '["clm_wiki_generac_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
