  ('cs_generac_operations', 'org_generac', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Recognition Generac is a recipient of Milwaukee Magazine ’s “Best Places to Work” award for Southeastern Wisconsin. [1] Generac''s industrial sizing application, Power Design Pro, received silver in the 2010 Plant Engineering "Product of the Year" award. [2] The company has also earned the Good Housekeeping Seal for its Guardian Series home standby generators and several portable generators. [3] Generac was honored with the 2014 Natural Gas Generator Company of the Year Award from Frost &amp; Sullivan for its contribution to the North American natural gas generator set industry. [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Budde, Andrea (May 30, 2012). "Generac named among top workplaces in area" . Living Lake Country . Retrieved 28 July 2013 . ^ "Product of the Year 2010 Winners | Plant Engineering" . Archived from the original on 2013-10-18 . Retrieved 2011-12-30 . ^ "Generac Power Systems Earns Good Housekeeping Seal" . Rental Equipment Register magazine. May 15, 2009 . Retrieved 28 July 2013 . ^ "GENERAC POWER SYSTEMS EARNS FROST &amp; SULLIVAN''S COMPANY OF THE YEAR AWARD" . Generac Power Systems, Inc.', '["clm_wiki_generac_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
