   'Honeywell Aerospace Inc. is an independent American manufacturer of aircraft engines, avionics, auxiliary power units (APUs), and other aviation systems. Headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona, it operates as one of the world''s largest standalone tier-1 aerospace and defense suppliers. The company generates approximately $15 billion in annual revenue from a balanced portfolio of commercial and military defense contracts.', '["clm_wiki_honeywell-aerospace_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
