   version, created_at, updated_at, display_order, claim_count, source_count, last_verified_at)
VALUES
  ('cs_humana_operations', 'org_humana', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Sponsorship Humana is the presenting sponsor of the Grand Ole Opry [1] and the National Senior Games . [2] Since 1979, Humana has been a principal sponsor of the annual Humana Festival of New American Plays in Louisville, Kentucky. [3] Humana was a tour partner of the PGA Tour beginning from 2005 to 2015. [4] [5] The Humana Distaff Handicap is a Grade 1 race for thoroughbred fillies and mares , four-years-old and up. The race is run each spring on Kentucky Derby day at Churchill Downs and set at a distance of 7 furlongs for a purse of $250,000. &#91; citation needed &#93; ^ body:not( ):not( ) "About the Opry" . Grand Ole Opry . Archived from the original on June 16, 2013 . Retrieved August 17, 2016 . ^ "National Senior Games Association" . nsga . Archived from the original on March 24, 2024 . Retrieved April 26, 2024 . ^ "Humana Festival of New American Plays" . Humana Foundation. Archived from the original on July 15, 2014 . Retrieved August 17, 2016 . ^ Smith, Michael (January 13, 2013). "Humana broadens marketing partnership with PGA Tour" . Sports Business Journal . Archived from the original on December 12, 2025 . Retrieved October 20, 2025 . ^ Bohannan, Larry (September 29, 2014). "Humana ending role as PGA Tour sponsor" . The Desert Sun . Retrieved December 3, 2025 .', '["clm_wiki_humana_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
