  ('cs_huntington-ingalls_overview', 'org_huntington-ingalls', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc., (HII) is the largest military shipbuilding company in the United States as well as a provider of professional services to partners in government and industry. HII was formed on March 31, 2011, as a divestiture from Northrop Grumman.', '["clm_wiki_huntington-ingalls_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
