   'Ingersoll Rand Inc. is an American multinational company that provides industrial products. The company was formed in February 2020 through the spinoff of the industrial segment of Ingersoll-Rand plc and its merger with Gardner Denver.', '["clm_wiki_ingersoll-rand_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
