   'Intercontinental Exchange, Inc. (ICE) is an American multinational financial services company that operates global financial exchanges, including stock exchanges and futures exchanges, as well as clearing houses, and provides technology and services for mortgage loan origination, closing, and servicing.', '["clm_wiki_intercontinental-exchange_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
