  ('cs_labcorp_overview', 'org_labcorp', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Labcorp Holdings Inc., operating under the brand name Labcorp, headquartered in Burlington, North Carolina, provides laboratory services used for diagnosis and healthcare decisions. It operates one of the largest clinical laboratory networks in the world and has operations in over 100 countries; although its operations are primarily in the U.S.', '["clm_wiki_labcorp_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
