VALUES
  ('cs_nxp-semiconductors_overview', 'org_nxp-semiconductors', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'NXP Semiconductors N.V. is a Dutch semiconductor manufacturing and design company with headquarters in Eindhoven, Netherlands. It is the third largest European semiconductor company by market capitalization as of 2024. The company employs approximately 34,000 people in more than 30 countries and it reported revenues of $12.61 billion in 2024. The company''s name is an abbreviation of Next eXPerience. NXP customers include Apple, Dell, Ericsson and Samsung.', '["clm_wiki_nxp-semiconductors_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
