   'Service territory APS serves about two-thirds of the Phoenix metropolitan area. It primarily serves downtown and northern Phoenix, a large swath to the north and west of the city, and the downtown areas of Chandler , Gilbert , Glendale , Peoria , Scottsdale and Tempe . Outside of the Valley, it serves Flagstaff , Prescott , Yuma and Douglas .', '["clm_wiki_pinnacle-west-capital_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
