  ('cs_qnity-electronics_overview', 'org_qnity-electronics', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Qnity Electronics, Inc., headquartered in Wilmington, Delaware, is a major provider of materials for the semiconductor manufacturing and electronics industries. The company''s Semiconductor Technologies segment produces products for chemical-mechanical polishing, photolithography, sealing applications, and OLED displays. Its Interconnect Solutions segment provides products for signal integrity, including semiconductor coatings, thermal and electromagnetic shielding, and laminate materials. Kapton is a brand of the company.', '["clm_wiki_qnity-electronics_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
