  ('cs_raymond-james_leadership', 'org_raymond-james', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Current operations Raymond James has four main lines of operation: private client group, capital markets (made up of equity and fixed income capital markets as well as public finance), asset management group (made up of asset management services and Carillon tower advisers) and banking. [1] [2] [3] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Raymond James Financial" . Reuters . ^ "RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL INC.(RJF)- NYSE" . Investorsbuz . Retrieved December 19, 2016 . ^ Cite error: The named reference :0 was invoked but never defined (see the help page ).', '["clm_wiki_raymond-james_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
