VALUES
  ('cs_raymond-james_operations', 'org_raymond-james', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'History Raymond James was founded in 1962 when St. Petersburg broker, Robert James , formed Robert A. James Investments. In 1964, it merged with Raymond &amp; Associates, founded by Edward Raymond in 1963, to form Raymond James &amp; Associates. [1] Robert James'' son, Tom James , joined in 1966 and assumed leadership of the firm in 1970. The firm planned to go public in 1969, but market conditions delayed its plan until 1983. [2] Tom turned over the CEO''s post to Paul Reilly in 2010, [3] and his title as Chairman of the Board to Paul Reilly in 2016. [4] He remains on the leadership team as Chairman Emeritus. In 2012, the firm purchased the Canadian assets of Allied Irish Bank . [2] In April 2012, they merged with Morgan Keegan &amp; Company , creating one of the country''s largest full-service wealth management and investment banking firms not headquartered in New York. [5] As of the fiscal quarter ending September 30, 2022, the firm had delivered 139 consecutive quarters of profitability. [6] In June 2016, it was listed as a Fortune 500 company for the first time. [7] In September 2016, the firm announced its acquisition of Deutsche Bank Wealth Management''s US private client services unit, Alex Brown &amp; Sons . [8] In April 2017, the firm purchased Reams Asset Management from UMB Financial Corporation . The purchase, which amounted to $172.5 million, included Scouts Investments. [9] As of September 30, 2022, Raymond James has approximately 8,700 financial advisors throughout the United States, Canada and overseas. Total client assets under management are approximately $1.09 trillion. In January 2026, it was announced Raymond James had agreed to acquire Clark Capital Management Group, a Philadelphia-based asset management firm with more than $46 billion in assets under management. The transaction, expected to be finalised by the third quarter of 2026 subject to regulatory approval, will see Clark Capital continue to operate under its own name as an independent bout', '["clm_wiki_raymond-james_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
