  ('cs_resmed_leadership', 'org_resmed', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'History Resmed was established in June 1989 by Peter Farrell in Australia. The company opened an office in San Diego in 1992, and made that its headquarters two years later when it incorporated in the US. [1] [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Fikes, Bradley J. (September 5, 2016). "Peter Farrell joins Connect Hall of Fame" . The San Diego Union-Tribune . ^ Much, Marilyn (September 24, 2020). "A Top CEO Rebooted His Life To Refresh His Company" . Investor''s Business Daily .', '["clm_wiki_resmed_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
