  ('cs_royal-caribbean_leadership', 'org_royal-caribbean', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Brands and ships Royal Caribbean International Main article: Royal Caribbean International Royal Caribbean International (RCI) is a cruise line founded in 1969 in Norway . [1] [2] It reorganized as a wholly owned subsidiary in 1997 and was renamed to Royal Caribbean Group in 2020. [3] [4] Based in Miami, Florida , it is the largest cruise line by revenue and second largest by passenger counts . As of 2025, &#91;update&#93; Royal Caribbean International controlled 27.0% of the worldwide cruise market by passengers and 24.8% by revenue. [5] List of Royal Caribbean International ships Grandeur of the Seas [6] Enchantment of the Seas [7] Rhapsody of the Seas [8] Vision of the Seas [9] Voyager of the Seas [10] Explorer of the Seas [11] Adventure of the Seas [12] Navigator of the Seas [13] Mariner of the Seas [14] Radiance of the Seas [15] Brilliance of the Seas [16] Serenade of the Seas [17] Jewel of the Seas [18] Freedom of the Seas [19] Liberty of the Seas [20] Independence of the Seas [21] Oasis of the Seas [22] Allure of the Seas [23] Harmony of the Seas [24] Symphony of the Seas [25] Wonder of the Seas [26] Utopia of the Seas [27] Quantum of the Seas Anthem of the Seas Ovation of the Seas [28] Spectrum of the Seas Odyssey of the Seas [29] Icon of the Seas [30] Star of the Seas [31] Legend of the Seas [32] Celebrity Cruises Main article: Celebrity Cruises Celebrity Cruises is a cruise line headquartered in Miami, Florida , and is a wholly owned subsidiary of Royal Caribbean Group. [3] Celebrity Cruises was founded in 1988 by the Greece-based Chandris Group , and merged with Royal Caribbean Cruise Line in 1997. [33] [34] [35] List of Celebrity Cruises ships Celebrity Apex [36] Celebrity Ascent [37] Celebrity Beyond [38] Celebrity Eclipse [39] Celebrity Edge [40] Celebrity Equinox [41] Celebrity Reflection [42] Celebrity Silhouette [43] Celebrity Solstice [44] Celebrity Xcel [45] Celebrity Constellation [46] Celebrity Infinity [47] Celebrity Flora [48] Celebrity Millen', '["clm_wiki_royal-caribbean_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
