  ('cs_sp-global_leadership', 'org_sp-global', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   '19th century The predecessor companies of S&amp;P Global have histories dating to 1888, when James H. McGraw purchased the American Journal of Railway Appliances . He continued to add further publications, eventually establishing The McGraw Publishing Company in 1899.', '["clm_wiki_sp-global_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
