   version, created_at, updated_at, display_order, claim_count, source_count, last_verified_at)
VALUES
  ('cs_synchrony_operations', 'org_synchrony', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'Synchrony-branded educational initiatives In 2016, the University of Connecticut ''s School of Engineering announced the launch of Synchrony''s Center of Excellence in Cybersecurity. [1] In 2018, Synchrony opened an emerging tech center at the University of Illinois . [2] In 2019, Synchrony opened the Synchrony Digital Technology Center at the University of Connecticut''s Stamford campus . [3] During the dedication of the center, the company announced a $1 million donation to the "Connecticut Commitment" – an initiative aimed at helping lower-income Connecticut students attend the university, tuition-free. [3] Synchrony operates "Innovation Stations" in Stamford, Connecticut; Chicago, Illinois; Kettering, Ohio and Hyderabad, India. [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Mahoney, Sara (October 12, 2016). "UConn Establishes Synchrony Financial Center of Excellence in Cybersecurity" . UConn Today . Retrieved May 20, 2019 . ^ Bliell, Laura (April 12, 2018). "Synchrony Opens Emerging Tech Center at the University of Illinois to Develop Artificial Intelligence Solutions" . Synchrony Financial . Retrieved May 20, 2019 . ^ a b "Synchrony Digital Technology Center Dedicated; Gift to Connecticut Commitment Announced" . UConn Today . December 16, 2019 . Retrieved May 19, 2020 . ^ "synchrony-financial-to-invest-12-m-in-hyderabad-facility" . The Hindu . April 29, 2016.', '["clm_wiki_synchrony_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
