  ('cs_t-rowe-price_leadership', 'org_t-rowe-price', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Awards and recognition 2017 Ranked one of the World''s Most Admired Companies by Fortune [1] [2] 2016 Top Companies for Women Technologists by the Anita Borg Institute Leadership Index [3] 2015 P&amp;I Best Places to Work in Money Management by Pension&amp;Investments [4] 2015 Best Employers for Healthy Lifestyle by the National Business Group on Health [5] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "2017 World''s Most Admired Survey" . Fortune . Retrieved February 21, 2017 . ^ "World''s Most Admired Companies - T. Rowe Price - Securities and Asset Management" . Fortune . Retrieved February 21, 2017 . ^ "ABI Names Highest Scoring Organizations from 2016 Top Companies Program" . Anita Borg Institute . October 6, 2016 . Retrieved February 15, 2017 . ^ "P&amp;I Best Places to Work 2015" . Pensions and Investments. December 14, 2015 . Retrieved February 23, 2017 . ^ "Best Employers for Healthy Lifestyles" . National Business Group on Health. June 17, 2015 . Retrieved February 20, 2017 .', '["clm_wiki_t-rowe-price_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
