VALUES
  ('cs_t-rowe-price_operations', 'org_t-rowe-price', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'American publicly owned investment firm T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : TROW S&amp;P 500 component Industry Investment Management Founded 1937 &#59;&#32;89 years ago ( 1937 ) Founder Thomas Rowe Price Jr. Headquarters 1307 Point Street , Baltimore , Maryland, U.S. , U.S. Key people Rob Sharps ( chairman , president &amp; CEO ) Products Asset Management Wealth Management Revenue US$ 7.09 billion (2024) Operating income US$2.33 billion (2024) Net income US$2.14 billion (2024) AUM US$1.73 trillion (August 2025) Total assets US$13.5 billion (2024) Total equity US$10.5 billion (2024) Number of employees 8,158 (2024) ASN body:not( ):not( ) 6566 Website troweprice Footnotes [1] [2] T. Rowe Price Group, Inc. is an American publicly owned global investment management firm that offers funds , subadvisory services, separate account management, and retirement plans and services for individuals, institutions, and financial intermediaries. [3] The firm has assets under management of more than $1.51 trillion and annual revenues of $6.48 billion as of 2023, placing it 537 on the Fortune 1000 list of the largest U.S. companies. [4] Headquartered at 1307 Point Street in Baltimore , Maryland, it has 7,868 employees [4] across 17 international offices with clients in 55 countries. [5] The firm was founded in 1937 by Thomas Rowe Price Jr. who is best known for developing the growth stock philosophy of investing. As of 2019, the company is focused on active management after strategically deciding against a major initiative in passive investment. [6] T. Rowe Price was named one of the best places to work in money management by Pensions &amp; Investments and was one of Fortune &#39; most admired companies in 2020. [7] [8] Listed on Nasdaq under the stock ticker TROW since 1986, T. Rowe Price is a component of the Nasdaq Financial-100 and S&amp;P 500 indices. ^ "T. Rowe Price names new CEO as Stromberg looks to retire" . Pensions&amp;Investments . July 29, 2021 . Re', '["clm_wiki_t-rowe-price_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
