VALUES
  ('cs_hsbc-bank-usa_leadership', 'org_hsbc-bank-usa', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Beginnings The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation began its presence in the United States market in 1865 when it opened an office in San Francisco , California . That office became a full-fledged branch in 1875, and in 1880 the bank opened its first East Coast branch in New York City. [1] ^ King, Frank - The History of The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation , volumes 1-4 - Cambridge University Press , 1987-1991', '["clm_wiki_hsbc-bank-usa_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
