  ('cs_webster-bank_history', 'org_webster-bank', 'overview', 'History',
   'American regional bank Webster Financial Corporation Headquarters in Stamford, Connecticut Type Public company Traded as NYSE : WBS S&amp;P 400 component Industry Finance Founded 1935 &#59;&#32;91 years ago ( 1935 ) in Waterbury, Connecticut Headquarters Stamford, Connecticut , U.S. Key people John R. Ciulla, President and CEO James C. Smith, Chairman Products Banking Revenue US$ 3.94 billion [1] (2023) Net income US$868 million [1] (2023) AUM US$70 billion [1] (2023) Total assets US$75.1 billion [1] (2023) Total equity US$8.7 billion [1] (2023) Number of employees Approximately 3,400 Website websterbank Webster Bank footprint (as of 2026) Webster Bank in Hamden, Connecticut Webster Bank is an American commercial bank based in Stamford, Connecticut . It has 177 branches and 316 ATMs located in Connecticut; Massachusetts; Rhode Island; New Jersey ; Westchester , Orange , Ulster , and Rockland counties in New York as well as New York City . [2] ^ a b c d e body:not( ):not( ) "Webster Financial Corporation 2023 Annual Report" (PDF) . Retrieved December 7, 2023 . ^ "Banking Centers and ATMs" . Jay Webster Financial Corporation . Retrieved May 14, 2024 .', '["clm_wiki_webster-bank_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
