  ('cs_cibc-bank-usa_leadership', 'org_cibc-bank-usa', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Community partnership CIBC Bank USA holds the naming rights to the CIBC Theatre (formerly The PrivateBank Theatre, The LaSalle Bank Theatre, and The Bank of America Theatre), a performing arts venue in Chicago''s Loop . [1] The theater officially adopted the CIBC branding on September 18, 2017. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) Di Nunzio, Miriam (September 18, 2017). "Canada''s CIBC acquires naming rights to The PrivateBank Theatre" . Chicago Sun-Times . Retrieved May 11, 2018 . ^ Rivera, S. (September 18, 2017). "PrivateBank Theatre changing name" . WGN-TV . Retrieved May 11, 2018 .', '["clm_wiki_cibc-bank-usa_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
