  ('cs_wintrust_history', 'org_wintrust', 'overview', 'History',
   'Services The company provides traditional retail and commercial banking services, as well as wealth management services, commercial and life insurance premium financing, and certain treasury management services such as data processing of payrolls and billings. [1] In 2015 Wintrust began to expand into equipment financing, both directly through its bank branches and indirectly through dealers. [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Wintrust: Who We Are" . Wintrust Financial. ^ Neuffer, Phil (March 2016). "Explosive Success, Disciplined Approach: Wintrust''s Swift Ascension" . Monitor Daily .', '["clm_wiki_wintrust_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
