  ('cs_sofi_overview', 'org_sofi', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'SoFi Technologies, Inc. is an American financial technology company. It was founded in 2011 to refinance student loans for Stanford University graduates. SoFi operates as a direct bank serving retail customers and businesses, and is the largest U.S.-based online lender. It has nearly 16 million customers as of 2026.', '["clm_wiki_sofi_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
