   'Commercial bank Texas Capital Bancshares, Inc. Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : TCBI S&amp;P 400 component Industry Banking Founded 1998 &#59;&#32;28 years ago ( 1998 ) Headquarters Dallas, Texas , U.S. Key people Rob C. Holmes ( president and CEO ) Revenue US$ 1.26 billion (FY ''25) [1] Net income US$313.8 million (FY ''25) [1] Total assets US$31.5 billion (FYE ''25) [2] Number of employees Approx. 2,200 Website texascapitalbank Texas Capital Bank is a bank headquartered in Dallas, Texas . The bank has branches located in every major city in Texas. Its parent bank holding company is Texas Capital Bancshares. It also operates an online-only banking division, Bask Bank . ^ a b body:not( ):not( ) "TCBI Income Statement - Texas Capital Bancshares, Inc. Stock - Yahoo Finance" . finance . ^ "TCBI Quarterly Report" .', '["clm_wiki_texas-capital-bank_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
