VALUES
  ('cs_city-national-bank-of-florida_leadership', 'org_city-national-bank-of-florida', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Awards and recognition City National Bank of Florida has been recognized for its community involvement and has held an “Outstanding” community reinvestment rating from the Office of the Comptroller of the Currency (OCC) for the past 18 years. [1] It continues to be one of the most liquid and best capitalized banks in Florida and is rated 5 stars "Superior" by BauerFinancial. [2] CNBFL was named one of the Best Banks to Work For by American Banker magazine, for two consecutive years. [3] CNBFL was voted Best Community Bank, Best Business Bank, Best Bank for Commercial Real Estate, Best Bank for Jumbo Loans, Best Private Bank and Best Foreign National Mortgage Lender by the readers of the Daily Business Review for the eight consecutive years as of 2020. [4] The South Florida Business Journal named it Business of the Year in 2013 and Community Bank of the Year in 2013 and 2011. [5] CNBFL was the only retail bank in Florida that had no customer complaints [6] filed against it with state regulators in 2011. The bank posted record earnings in 2012. [7] These benchmarks have earned City National Bank recognition by the community, media and analysts: Named Business of the Year by the South Florida Business Journal in 2013 [2] Voted the Best Business Bank by the readers of the Daily Business Review [8] in 2012 5-Star “Superior” rating by BauerFinancial since June 2012 [2] Jorge Gonzalez named Ultimate CEO by the South Florida Business Journal [9] Named the South Florida Business Journal''s Local/Community Bank of the Year in 2011. *Recognized by the South Florida Business Journal and received the Outstanding Community Service Award in 2012 [10] Mara Suarez named Businesswoman of the Year by the Coral Gables Chamber of Commerce in 2013 [11] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "City National Bank of Florida Announces Agreement to Acquire Executive Banking Corporation" . www . 2019-09-26 . Retrieved 2021-06-03 . ^ a b c "City National Bank of Florida MAIN" . Retrieved 2021-06-03 . ^ "Best Bank', '["clm_wiki_city-national-bank-of-florida_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
