  ('cs_united-community-bank_overview', 'org_united-community-bank', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'United Community is an American bank. United is one of the largest full-service financial institutions in the Southeast, with $28.2 billion in assets and 200 offices in Alabama, Florida, Georgia, North Carolina, South Carolina and Tennessee. In addition to its presence in the Southeast, United Community is the largest bank headquartered in South Carolina by total asset size.', '["clm_wiki_united-community-bank_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
