  ('cs_first-financial-bank_leadership', 'org_first-financial-bank', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Indiana In September 2021, First Financial Corporation announced on September 27 that The Morris Plan Company of Terre Haute, long a subsidiary of the company, [1] would be merged into First Financial Bank, effective December 31, 2021. [2] ^ Cite error: The named reference FFB was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ body:not( ):not( ) Greninger, Howard (September 27, 2021). "TH First Financial Corp. merges with The Morris Plan" . Terre Haute Tribune-Star . Retrieved September 28, 2021 .', '["clm_wiki_first-financial-bank_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
