VALUES
  ('cs_gap_operations', 'org_gap', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'International presence Gap in Hillcrest Mall The closing down sale at the Gap store in Westfield Sydney Including both company-owned and franchised stores, as of June 2018, there were Gap, Banana Republic , Athleta, Intermix, or Old Navy stores in 43 countries. [1] In January 2008, Gap signed a deal with Marinopoulos Group to open Gap and Banana Republic stores in Greece, Romania, Bulgaria, Cyprus, and Croatia. [2] In February 2009, Elbit Imaging, Ltd. secured a franchise to open and operate Gap and Banana Republic stores in Israel. [3] In August 2010, the company opened its first store in Melbourne , Australia at Chadstone Shopping Centre . [4] [5] In September 2011, Komax opened the first Gap store in Chile, due to a franchise. [6] In October 2011, the first GAP store opened in Warsaw , Poland. [7] Gap has a store in New Delhi, India which opened in May 2015. On February 20, 2016, Gap launched stores in Mumbai at Oberoi Mall and Infinity-2. In May 2016, Gap Inc. announced it would shutter all Old Navy stores in Japan in response to poor Q1 performance for Old Navy and consistent losses across the organization. [8] In 2017, Gap closed all seven of its stores in Israel. [9] In 2018, Gap closed all its stores in Australia. [10] By May 2021, Gap operated company-owned stores in the United States, Canada, Mexico, the United Kingdom, France, India, Italy, the Czech Republic, Ireland, Japan, Philippines, China, and Taiwan. [11] However, in June 2021, Gap confirmed plans to close all its 81 stores in the UK and Ireland and go online-only. The company said it would close all its stores "in a phased manner" between the end of August and the end of September. At the same time, Gap said it was in negotiations with another firm to take over all of its French stores. In Italy, Gap said it was in discussions with a partner for the potential acquisition of the stores there. [12] In September 2021, Gap and British clothes retailer Next announced a joint venture that will see Next ', '["clm_wiki_gap_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
-- 913. SLB (slug=slb, wiki='SLB')
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
  (id, entity_id, section_type, heading, body_markdown, claim_ids, source_ids,
   reading_level, language, author_type, generator_version, editorial_status,
