   'The Goodyear Tire & Rubber Company, commonly known as Goodyear, is an American multinational tire manufacturer headquartered in Akron, Ohio. Since 2021, the company has been the world''s third-largest tire manufacturer by annual revenue.', '["clm_wiki_goodyear-tire-and-rubber_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
