  ('cs_barnes-noble_overview', 'org_barnes-noble', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Barnes & Noble Booksellers is an American bookseller with the largest number of retail outlets in the United States. The company operates approximately 700+ retail stores across the United States.', '["clm_wiki_barnes-noble_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
