   'Red Hat, LLC is an American software company that provides open source software products to enterprises and is a subsidiary of IBM. Founded in 1993, Red Hat has its corporate headquarters in Raleigh, North Carolina, with other offices worldwide.', '["clm_wiki_red-hat_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
