  ('cs_bausch-lomb_overview', 'org_bausch-lomb', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Bausch & Lomb is a Canadian eye health products company based in Vaughan, Ontario, Canada. It is one of the world''s largest suppliers of contact lenses, lens care products, pharmaceuticals, intraocular lenses, and other eye surgery products. The company was founded in Rochester, New York, in 1853 by optician John Bausch and cabinet maker turned financial backer Henry Lomb. Until its sale in 2013, Bausch + Lomb was one of the oldest continually operating companies in the United States.', '["clm_wiki_bausch-lomb_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
