VALUES
  ('cs_pall_leadership', 'org_pall', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Details Today, the company is divided into two separate, integrated businesses: Pall Life Sciences and Pall Industries . The Scientific &amp; Lab Services employed 175 people worldwide at 29 locations, in 2011. The R&amp;D group has 12 sites, with seven in the United States. The main industrial technical center is at Cortland, NY. [1] Pall has plants in New Port Richey , DeLand, Florida , Cortland, New York , Timonium, Maryland , Fajardo, Puerto Rico , Ilfracombe , Portsmouth and locations around the world. In 2013 it announced plans to close its plants in Ann Arbor and Fort Myers, Florida . [2] ^ Cite error: The named reference overview was invoked but never defined (see the help page ). ^ Fort Myers; Business Briefs July 2013 Florida Trend', '["clm_wiki_pall_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
