  ('cs_allegheny_overview', 'org_allegheny', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'ATI Inc. is an American producer of specialty materials headquartered in Dallas, Texas. ATI produces metals including titanium and titanium alloys, nickel-based alloys and superalloys, stainless and specialty steels, zirconium, hafnium, and niobium, tungsten materials, forgings and castings.', '["clm_wiki_allegheny_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
