  ('cs_federal-deposit-insurance_history', 'org_federal-deposit-insurance', 'overview', 'History',
   'Current board members The current board members as of May 24,&#32;2026 &#91;update&#93; : [1] Position Name Party Assumed office Term expiration Chairman Travis Hill Republican January 5, 2023 December 21, 2028 Member Comptroller of the Currency ( ex officio ) Jonathan Gould Republican July 15, 2025 July 15, 2030 Member Director, CFPB ( ex officio ) Russell Vought (acting) Republican February 7, 2025 — Member Vacant — N/a — December 21, 2028 Member Vacant — N/a — May 31, 2030 ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Board of Directors &amp; Senior Executives" . State . U.S. Department of State . Retrieved May 24, 2026 .', '["clm_wiki_federal-deposit-insurance_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
