  ('cs_kaman_overview', 'org_kaman', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Kaman Corporation is an American aerospace company, with headquarters in Bloomfield, Connecticut. It was founded in 1945 by Charles Kaman. During the first ten years the company operated exclusively as a designer and manufacturer of several helicopters that set world records and achieved many aviation firsts.', '["clm_wiki_kaman_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
