  ('cs_tennant_overview', 'org_tennant', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'The Tennant Company (TNC:NYQ) is a company with about 4500 employees that provides cleaning products. Headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota, it is listed on the New York Stock Exchange.', '["clm_wiki_tennant_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
