  ('cs_rubrik_history', 'org_rubrik', 'overview', 'History',
   'American cloud data management company Rubrik, Inc. Formerly ScaleData, Inc. Type Public Traded as NYSE : RBRK (Class A) Russell 1000 component ISIN US7811541090 Industry Cyber Security and Data Security Founded January 2014 &#59;&#32;12 years ago ( January 2014 ) Founders Bipul Sinha,Arvind Jain, Soham Mazumdar, Arvind Nithrakashyap Headquarters Palo Alto, California , U.S. Key people Bipul Sinha (CEO) [1] Products Cloud management Backup Business continuity planning Revenue US$ 628 million (2023) [1] Net income US$−354 million (2023) [1] Owners Lightspeed Venture Partners (24%) Greylock Partners (12%) Bipul Sinha (7.6%) Arvind Jain (7%) Arvind Nithrakashyap (6.7%) [1] Number of employees 3,100 [1] (2024) Website rubrik Rubrik, Inc. is an American cloud data management and data security company based in Palo Alto, California , founded in January 2014. [2] The company is listed on the New York Stock Exchange after going public in April 2024. [3] ^ a b c d e body:not( ):not( ) Novet, Jordan (April 1, 2024). "Rubrik files to go public as tech companies see thawing of IPO market" . CNBC. ^ "Bloomberg: Rubrik Inc Latest News" . Bloomberg . Retrieved 20 May 2019 . ^ Goswami, Jordan Novet, Rohan (2024-04-25). "Rubrik pops 20% in NYSE debut after pricing IPO above range" . CNBC . Retrieved 2024-04-25 . : CS1 maint: multiple names: authors list ( link )', '["clm_wiki_rubrik_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
