  ('cs_rubrik_leadership', 'org_rubrik', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Controversies In March 2018, Dell EMC sued two former employees that currently work for Rubrik, alleging that the employees downloaded Dell EMC trade secrets, solicited former Dell EMC customers, and provided unfair competitive advantages to Rubrik. [1] [2] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Dell EMC in bid to clap trade secrets injunction on staff now at Rubrik" . The Register (UK) . Retrieved 31 March 2018 . ^ "Dell EMC targets another startup with trade secrets claim" . www . Retrieved 31 March 2018 .', '["clm_wiki_rubrik_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
