   version, created_at, updated_at, display_order, claim_count, source_count, last_verified_at)
VALUES
  ('cs_rubrik_operations', 'org_rubrik', 'overview', 'Operations',
   'History The company was founded in January 2014 by Bipul Sinha, Arvind Jain, Soham Mazumdar, and Arvind Nithrakashyap. [1] [2] [3] Institutional Venture Partners (IVP) led a US$180 million Series D funding round in May 2017, at a US$1.3 billion valuation, bringing the company to at least US$292 million raised to date. [4] [5] In early 2018, Rubrik purchased Datos.io, another cloud data management company. [6] In January 2019, the startup has raised $261 million, which helped it to reach $3.3 billion total valuation. The core investors were Bain Capital Ventures together with Lightspeed Venture Partners , Greylock Partners , Khosla Ventures and IVP. [7] In December 2020, the company purchased the assets and intellectual property of Igneous, a Seattle-based company that had recently gone through a mass layoff. Until shortly before the acquisition, Igneous was led by co-founder Kiran Bhageshpur. [8] In August 2023, it was announced Rubrik had acquired the Israel -headquartered cloud data security company, Laminar Security for 200 million dollars, [9] [10] On April 25, 2024, Rubrik began trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the ticker symbol RBRK. The company had priced its initial public offering at $32 per share, above its initial target range, raising $752 million at a $5.6 billion valuation. Shares rose 16% on the first day of trading. [11] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Stealthy upstart Rubrik: We''ll make enterprise data ''beautiful'' " . The Register (UK) . Retrieved 31 March 2018 . ^ "Meet Rubrik, yet another unicorn from Silicon Valley Indians" . VCCircle . 12 June 2017. ^ Kepes, Ben. "With An A-Grade Founding Team And A-Grade Investors, Rubrik Launches" . Forbes . Retrieved 31 March 2018 . ^ Levy, Ari (28 April 2017). "Red-hot software start-up Rubrik has zoomed to a $1.3 billion valuation in two years" . CNBC . ^ "Ten Reasons Why IVP Invested in Rubrik – IVP" . www . Retrieved 31 March 2018 . ^ "Rubrik buys Datos.io" . www . Retrieved 31 March 2018 . ^ "Data mana', '["clm_wiki_rubrik_operations"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   40, 1, 1, unixepoch());
