   'American aluminum manufacturer Century Aluminum Company Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : CENX S&amp;P 600 component Founded 1995 &#59;&#32;31 years ago ( 1995 ) Century Aluminum Company is a US-based producer of primary aluminum, with aluminum plants in Kentucky , South Carolina , and Iceland . It is the largest producer of primary aluminum in the United States. [1] The company is a publicly held corporation listed on the NASDAQ . The headquarters is at One South Wacker in Chicago . [2] [3] ^ US Department of Commerce, [1] , Section 232 Report on Aluminum, 2018. ^ New York Times, Century Aluminum Company , accessed 1 Mar. 2016. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Century Aluminum moving HQ from California to One South Wacker" . JLL . Retrieved 2016-08-02 .', '["clm_wiki_century-aluminum_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
