VALUES
  ('cs_century-aluminum_leadership', 'org_century-aluminum', 'overview', 'Leadership',
   'Operations The company operates three aluminum smelters in the US, and one in Iceland . Construction of a fifth smelter in Iceland has been halted since 2009. All Century''s operations produce primary aluminum, that is, aluminum from ore, rather than from aluminum scrap. In 2014, the company produced 881,000 metric tons of aluminum. [1] Hawesville, Kentucky Mount Holly, South Carolina Robards, Kentucky (Sebree) Grundartangi, Hvalfjarðarsveit , Iceland Helguvik, Reykjanesbær , Iceland (construction halted) As of late 2015, Century was suffering from low aluminum prices, and threatened to close its South Carolina plant, and lay off 600 workers, if it did not obtain less expensive electricity. [2] Century made an agreement with Santee Cooper Power in December 2015, under which it would run the Mount Holly smelter at half capacity. [3] In 2015, Century announced the permanent closure of its Ravenswood, West Virginia plant, which had formerly employed 650 workers, citing high energy costs and economic headwinds. [4] Similarly, in July 2022, Century idled its Hawesville, Kentucky, plant, citing "soaring energy prices." [5] Before its curtailment, the company billed its Hawesville smelter as the "largest producer of high purity primary aluminum in North America," employing hundreds of workers. The smelter was still idled as of late 2024. ^ Century Aluminum , accessed 1 Mar. 2016. ^ "Century Aluminum threatens to close Mt Holly smelter if no new power deal" , Reuters, 22 Oct. 2015. ^ Dan Hason, “Century Aluminum Company and Santee Cooper Power reached agreement” Business Finance News, 21 Dec. 2015. ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Ravenswood Century Aluminum Plant Permanently Shut Down" . West Virginia Public Broadcasting . Associated Press. 2015-07-28 . Retrieved 2024-11-28 . ^ "Century Aluminum Company - Hawesville, KY" . centuryaluminum . Retrieved 2024-11-28 .', '["clm_wiki_century-aluminum_leadership"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'orgs_sections_v1', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   30, 1, 1, unixepoch());
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO content_section
