6. ^ Council, Stephen (October 24, 2024). "Bay Area tech company Upwork announces $28M profit, slashes staff by 21%" . SF Gate . Retrieved April 29, 2026 . ^ Lunden, Ingrid (May 5, 2015). "Elance-oDesk Rebrands As Upwork, Debuts Slack-Like Chat Platform" . TechCrunch . Retrieved May 17, 2016 .', '["clm_wiki_upwork_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
