VALUES
  ('cs_fortress-biotech_history', 'org_fortress-biotech', 'overview', 'History',
   'html body This article may have been created or edited in return for undisclosed payments , a violation of Wikipedia''s terms of use . It may require cleanup to comply with Wikipedia''s content policies , particularly neutral point of view . See our advice if the article is about you and read our scam warning in case someone asks for money to edit this article. ( March 2021 ) Fortress Biotech Inc. Type Public Traded as Nasdaq : FBIO Russell 2000 Index component Industry Biopharmaceuticals Founded 2006 Founder Dr. Lindsay Allan Rosenwald Headquarters Bay Harbor Islands, Florida Key people Lindsay A. Rosenwald, M.D.(Chairman/ President/CEO) Michael S. Weiss (Executive Vice Chairman) Eric K. Rowinsky, M.D. (Co-Vice Chairman) Jimmie Harvey, Jr., M.D. (Director) Website www Fortress Biotech Inc. , commonly known as Fortress Bio , is a biopharmaceutical company that acquires, develops, and commercializes innovative pharmaceutical and biotechnology products. Led by CEO Lindsay A. Rosenwald , M.D., Fortress and most of its subsidiary companies are headquartered in Bay Harbor Islands, Florida . [1] [2] [3] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "Fortress Biotech: A Drug Financing Experiment Expands" . invivo . Retrieved 1 November 2018 . ^ "Biotechnology Company Overview of Fortress Biotech, Inc" . Bloomberg Businessweek . Retrieved 1 November 2018 . ^ "Contact" . Fortress Biotech, Inc . Retrieved 2022-07-20 .', '["clm_wiki_fortress-biotech_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
